,"scoID":["2-s2.0-85198622598"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Non-Profit Organisations","Region Zealand","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-051cfdf4-9848-4d58-99e3-b6bf37137e15"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Biopsy-verified vulvar lichen sclerosus and the risk of non-vulvar cancer : A nationwide cohort study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-764586","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
