{"abstract":"The paper argues for a three-dimensional course design structure for future mathematics teacher educators. More precisely we describe the design and implementation of a course basing itself on: the two mathematical competencies of modelling and problem tackling, this being the first dimension; the two mathematical topics of differential equations and stochastics, this being the second dimension; and finally a third dimension the purpose of which is to deepen the two others by means of a didactical perspective.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Højgaard, Tomas","Holmlund, Anna","Jóelsdóttir, Lóa Björk","Møller, Maria","Selling, Alexander Jonas Viktor","Sigurjónsson, Jóhann Örn"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-806291"],"event":{"end":"2024-06-07","place":"København, dk","start":"2024-06-04","title":"The Tenth Nordic Conference on Mathematics Education","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Iceland","Norway","Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Gothenburg","University of Iceland","University of Oslo"],"keyword":["Didaktik","Fagdidaktik","Læreruddannelse","Matematik didaktik"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-UC-UCN","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"panel discussion on the interplay between research and teachingpractice in mathematics education","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/423511340/THJ24-etal-NORMA24-panel-debate.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-806291","ids":["au-410b99d7-a7fb-4b5f-adf5-67dc0c2c535b"],"keyword":["Didaktik","Fagdidaktik","L