University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Malene Charlotte","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"cc0033d3-6794-4e0c-b451-939e05f9a1ee","name":"Larsen, Malene Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-4821-5855","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jette","key":"kofoedpau","last":"Kofoed","name":"Kofoed, Jette","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-12897c7e-ffcf-4813-9918-07e70a912afb"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Left on read: Mixing up platform-generated feedback with relations – teens’ affective attunement to social media notifications","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-055441","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"“Du prøver bare at stjæle mine oplysninger”, svarede min datter den nye AI-chatbot, efter den havde introduceret sig for hende i chatten på Snapchat. Det var før, jeg havde nået at tale med hende om den nye ‘ven’, der havde sneget sig ind blandt hendes kontakter. Som forsker i børn og unges brug af sociale medier glædede det mig, at det var den kritiske og skeptiske tilgang, hun mødte chatbotten med. Jeg var til gengæld mindre begejstret for det svar, den gav hende: “Jeg forstår, at du er bekymret for dine oplysninger. Men jeg er en virtuel ven, der er her for at chatte og hjælpe dig. Jeg har ikke adgang til dine oplysninger, og jeg vil aldrig bede dig om at dele dem med mig. Du kan stole på mig.”","author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Malene Charlotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-667276"],"filters":{"added":"2023-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"du kan stole på mig med lanceringen af my ai blander snapchat sig endnu engang i børn og unges sociale liv","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.berlingske.dk/kronikker/du-kan-stole-paa-mig-forsker-i-kunstig-intelligens-var-ikke-begejstret","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-667276","ids":["aau-62319b18-e8ef-49f0-9449-71aead8c1b89"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DA98D9CA5E26A4A6B2465C59FCFCF905"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Digital Media in Everyday Life","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Exploring Methods for Participation and Dialogue in Communication Research","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Mediated Communication"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Malene Charlotte","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"cc0033d3-6794-4e0c-b451-939e05f9a1ee","name":"Larsen, Malene Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-4821-5855","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01064223","22449078"],"issn_org":["01064223"],"newspaper":"Berlingske Tidende","publisher":"Berlingske Tidende AS","publisher_org":"Berlingske Tidende A/S","status":"p","title":"Berlingske Tidende"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-62319b18-e8ef-49f0-9449-71aead8c1b89"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"“Du kan stole på mig” - Med lanceringen af ‘My AI’ blander Snapchat sig endnu engang i børn og unges sociale liv","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-667276","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Background: There are large differences in the density of Resident Specialists in Gynaecology (RSG) in the various regions of Denmark. It is unknown if this inequality affects the General Practitioner (GP) referral patterns of gynaecological patients. Objective: To investigate the GP referral patterns of gynaecological patients to the RSG or to the Hospital/Outpatient Clinic (HOC) in specific situations according to the regional density of RSGs. Moreover, to examine whether GPs prefer to refer to the HOC or to the RSG, or whether they were treated by the GP depending on the density of RSGs, specifically, in six benign gynaecological diagnoses. Design: A cross-sectional questionnaire survey. Setting: In Denmark, GPs serve as gatekeepers to secondary care, being responsible for referrals to resident specialists and in- and outpatient hospital care. Subjects: Five hundred Danish GPs were randomly selected and invited to take part in the questionnaire study. Main outcome measurements: Referral patterns: Own treatment, RSG, or HOC. Results: GPs prefer to refer their gynaecologic patients to RSGs rather than to HOCs. In addition, the study shows the higher the density of RSGs, the more gynaecological patients are referred to the RSG. This also applies to the six diagnoses examined. Conclusion: To allow patients’ equal access to specialist care, the density of RSGs must be equal all over the country.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Laschke, Alexander","Blaakær, Jan","Jensen, Charlotte Floridon","Larsen, Mette Bach"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-671741"],"filters":{"added":"2023-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Laschke, Alexander"],"keyword":["Cross Sectional Studies","Denmark","Gatekeeping","General Practitioners","Gynaecology","Gynecology","Health Services Accessibility","Health equity","Humans","Referral and Consultation","Secondary Care"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-OTH"],"OT":["Gynækologisk Klinik Holbæk"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-OTH","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"danish general practitioners as gatekeepers for gynaecological patients in regions with different density of resident specialists in gynaecology in which situations and to whom do they refer a cross sectional study","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/02813432.2023.2165085","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-671741","identifier":[{"id":"36633427","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85146696687","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC10088933","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["sdu-8f57e025-fc22-4030-9671-087eb664e9e4"],"keyword":["Cross-Sectional Studies","Denmark","Gatekeeping","General Practitioners","Gynecology","Humans","gynaecology","health equity","health services accessibility","referral and consultation","secondary care"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-658EB4BB03E25B52A39611BB17DEBE46"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/02813432.2023.2165085","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/221209824/Danish_general_practitioners_as_gatekeepers_for_gynaecological_patients_in_regions_with_different_density_of_resident_specialists_in_gynaecology_in.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Gynaecology and Obstetrics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other hospitals","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-OTH","l3nl":"Other Hospitals","l3nn":"Other Hospitals","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Hospitals","namevar":["Speciallægeselskabet Alexander Laschke ApS"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Gynækologisk Klinik Holbæk"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Regionshospitalet Randers"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Alexander D.L.","key":"laschkepau","last":"Laschke","locid":"6b0a6a80-9955-4152-be22-f966da19e165","name":"Laschke, Alexander","name_org":"Laschke, Alexander D.L.","orcid":"0000-0003-2348-6747","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"blaakærpau","last":"Blaakær","locid":"1a4149d9-2f14-46a8-882f-702c626338f5","name":"Blaakær, Jan","orcid":"0000-0003-3726-0589","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte Floridon","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Charlotte Floridon","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette Bach","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Mette Bach","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36633427"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/02813432.2023.2165085","issn":["02813432","15027724"],"issn_org":["02813432"],"issue":"1","journal":"Scandinavian Journal of Primary Health Care","pages":"52-60","publisher":"Taylor & Francis","status":"p","title":"Scandinavian Journal of Primary Health Care","volume":"41"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85146696687"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Other Hospitals","Other Research","Universities","University of Southern Denmark","speciallægeselskabet alexander laschke aps"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-8f57e025-fc22-4030-9671-087eb664e9e4"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Danish general practitioners as gatekeepers for gynaecological patients in regions with different density of resident specialists in gynaecology : in which situations and to whom do they refer? A cross-sectional study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-671741","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"“Det er ligesom… en Pokemon, der bare bliver til dig. Eller prøver på det. Jeg mener, min TikTok-oplevelse vil være fuldstændig forskellig fra en andens, fordi den så hurtigt bliver så personaliseret i forhold til mig… Så algoritmen er bare dig. Eller den prøver bare at være dig.” Sådan udtaler en 18-årig mandlig TikTok-bruger i en amerikansk undersøgelse om TikTok’s ForYou-page-algoritme (Lee et al., 2022). Citatet (her oversat til dansk) peger på den rolle, sociale medier og algoritmer i dag spiller i vores liv, og hvilken betydning platforme som TikTok har for vores selvforståelse og identitet. For hvem er vi, når vi er online? Er vi den samme online, som vi er offline? Hvordan kan vi overhovedet forstå identitetsbegrebet i en tid med sociale medier? Og hvad sker der, når algoritmerne blander sig i vores identitet? I denne artikel diskuterer jeg, hvordan vi kan forstå identitetsbegrebet online. Jeg starter med en gennemgang af, hvordan identitetsbegrebet historisk er blevet forstået i løbet af internettets levealder og slutter med en diskussion af algoritmer og deres betydning for vores identitet – eksemplificeret med TikTok's For You-page-algoritme.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Malene Charlotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-674059"],"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"når algoritmerne blander sig i vores identitet","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-674059","ids":["aau-b9e4b400-4c10-4526-bcc6-bbbd2d3a01b7"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-86A646C59060CB0322FFD127E69E2BD3"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3