{"abstract":"The original version of this Article contained errors in the spelling of the authors Jens Søndergaard, Lisbeth Runge Larsen and Niels Wedderkopp, which were incorrectly given as Jens Søndergaarda, Lisbeth Runge Larseng and Niels Wedderkoppf. The original Article has been corrected.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Lykkegaard, Charlotte Raadkjær","Andersen, Helene Støttrup","Wehberg, Sonja","Holden, Sinead","Waldorff, Frans Boch","Søndergaard, Jens","Larsen, Lisbeth Runge","Klakk, Heidi","Wedderkopp, Niels"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-680296"],"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Lykkegaard, Charlotte Raadkjær"],"country":["Ireland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University College Dublin"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCL"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-UCL"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"author correction the association between childhood motor performance and developmental trajectories of sport participation over 000000000005 years in danish students aged 000000000006 000000000016 year old scientific reports 000000002023 000000000013 000000000001 000000004133 000000000010 000000001038 s000000041598 000000000023 000000031344 x","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-023-34564-3","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-680296","identifier":[{"id":"PMC10170063","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"37160994","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85158903958","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-57cc13c3-e782-45c1-96ed-36e9a869c58a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":[