{"abstract":"Consumption of traditional foods is decreasing amid a lifestyle transition in Greenland as incidence of type-2 diabetes (T2D) increases. In homozygous carriers of a TBC1D4 variant, conferring postprandial insulin resistance, the risk of developing T2D is markedly higher. We investigated the effects of traditional marine diets on glucose homeostasis and cardio-metabolic health in Greenlandic Inuit carriers and non-carriers of the variant. We conducted a randomized, crossover study consisting of two 4-week dietary interventions; Traditional (marine-based, low-carbohydrate) and Western (high in imported meats and carbohydrates). Oral glucose tolerance (OGTT, 2-h), 14-day continuous glucose and cardio-metabolic markers were assessed to investigate the effect of diet and genotype. Compared to the westernized diet, the Traditional diet reduced mean and maximum daily blood glucose by 0.17 mmol/L [95% CI;0.05, 0.29; P=0.006] and 0.26 mmol/L [95% CI;0.06, 0.46; P=0.010], respectively, with dose-dependency. Furthermore, it gave rise to a weight loss of 0.5 kg [95% CI; 0.09, 0.90; P=0.016] relative to the Western diet and 4% [95% CI;1, 9; P=0.018] lower LDL:HDL-cholesterol, which after adjustment for weight-loss appeared to be driven by HDL elevation (0.09 mmol/L [0.03, 0.15], P=0.006). A diet-gene interaction was indicated on insulin sensitivity in the OGTT (p=0.093), which seemed to reflect a non-significant increase of 1.4 [-0.6, 3.5] mmol/L in carrier 2-h glucose. A Traditional diet marginally improved daily glycaemic control and plasma lipid profile compared to a Western diet in Greenlandic Inuit. Possible adverse effects on glucose tolerance in carriers of the TBC1D4 variant warrants further studies of diet-gene interactions.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Lewis, Jack I.","Lind, Mads Vendelbo","Møller, Grith","Hansen, Torben","Pedersen, Hanne","Christensen, Marie M.B.","Laursen, Jens C.","Nielsen, Sara","Ottendahl, Charlotte Brandstrup","Larsen, Christina Viskum Lytken","Stark, Ken D.","Bjerregaard, Peter","Jørgensen, Marit E.","Lauritzen, Lotte"],"cuid":["S02-096.91-716513"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Lauritzen, Lotte"],"country":["Canada","Greenland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Grønlands Universitet","University of Greenland","University of Waterloo"],"keyword":["Cardiometabolic markers","Faculty of Science","Greenland","Insulin sensitivity","Marine diet","TBC1D4","n 3 LCPUFA"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-STENO"],"OT":["Steno Diabetes Centre, Gentofte, Denmark."],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-STENO","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the effect of traditional diet on glucose homeostasis in carriers and non carriers of a common i tbc000000000001d000000000004 i variant in greenlandic inuit a randomized crossover study","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1017/S000711452300106X","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-096.91-716513","identifier":[{"id":"85160908756","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC10632723","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"001010515900001","type":"wos"},{"id":"37129117","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-cdb34b4b-0dd9-40fd-bdcc-53010cadc239","sdu-84178170-f5da-4a58-a903-8b13233542bf"],"keyword":["Faculty of Science","Greenland","Lifestyle transition","Marine diet","TBC1D4","TBC1D4 genotype/p.Arg684Ter","TBC1D4 genotype/p.Arg684er","cardio-metabolic markers","insulin sensitivity","n-3 LCPUFA"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-2B3C0AD01366C18FAF3D96B83A9012D2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1017/S000711452300106X","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/232540275/the_effect_of_traditional_diet_on_glucose_homoeostasis_in_carriers_and_non_carriers_of_a_common_tbc1d4_variant_in_greenlandic_inuit_a_randomised_crossover_study.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/375209392/the_effect_of_traditional_diet_on_glucose_homoeostasis_in_carriers_and_non_carriers_of_a_common_tbc1d4_variant_in_greenlandic_inuit_a_randomised_crossover_study.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Nutrition, Exercise and Sports, Lifecourse Nutrition & Health"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"steno diabetes centers","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-STENO","l3nn":"Steno Diabetes Centers","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Steno Diabetes Centers","namevar":["Steno Diabetes Center Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-STENO","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Steno Diabetes Centre, Gentofte, Denmark."],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, National Institute of Public Health","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, National Institute of Public Health, Center for Public health in Greenland"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"ca","key":"university of waterloo","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Waterloo","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"gl","key":"grønlands universitet","loc":["Greenland","Nordic"],"name":"Grønlands Universitet","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"gl","key":"university of greenland","loc":["Greenland","Nordic"],"name":"University of Greenland","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Jack Ivor","key":"lewispau","last":"Lewis","locid":"fbca0b12-f3f7-43a0-981d-f68bb6f424d9","name":"Lewis, Jack Ivor","orcid":"0000-0001-9483-912X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mads Vendelbo","key":"lindpau","last":"Lind","locid":"55385a1f-1f1c-4701-a49a-99e30754a656","name":"Lind, Mads Vendelbo","orcid":"0000-0002-4999-1218","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Grith","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"97088e1a-ed46-4c15-9b8f-ff0d843f69d7","name":"Møller, Grith","orcid":"0000-0002-6512-8537","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Torben","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"6b6bfff1-8b14-468b-af77-e71b375018e0","name":"Hansen, Torben","orcid":"0000-0001-8748-3831","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Hanne","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Marie M.B.","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Marie M.B.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens C.","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","name":"Laursen, Jens C.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sara","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Sara","rank":8,"rolecode":"p