{"abstract":"I Region Sjælland har vi gode erfaringer med forskningspolitisk samarbejde, der skal reducere sundhedssystemets kapacitetsudfordringer og skabe bedre forudsætninger for folkesundheden i regionen, skriver sundhedsaktører.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Tang, Lars Hermann","Larsen, Charlotte Bøll","Ronex, Anne Møller","Pedersen, Anne Dalhoff","Skou, Søren Thorgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-637358"],"filters":{"added":"2022-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sundhedsaktører forskningspolitiske samarbejder forkorter vejen fra viden til implementering","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/sundhed/artikel/sundhedsaktoerer-invester-i-forskning-der-fremmer-fysisk-aktivitet","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-637358","ids":["sdu-dff34fd2-d893-418a-8f9a-b3291c7080ea"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7D2E053C40B8A993D00480BEC7B5C7DF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/sundhed/artikel/sundhedsaktoerer-invester-i-forskning-der-fremmer-fysisk-aktivitet","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS - Næstved, Slagelse, Ringsted Hospitals (NSR), Research Unit of Physiothera