{"abstract":"Five new polyketides were isolated from the rare filamentous fungus Aspergillus californicus IBT 16748 including calidiol A ( 1 ); three phthalide derivatives califuranones A1, A2, and B ( 2-4 ); and a pair of enantiomers (-)-calitetralintriol A (- 5 ) and (+)-calitetralintriol A (+ 5 ) together with four known metabolites ( 6-9 ). The structures of the new products were established by extensive spectroscopic analyses including HRMS and 1D and 2D NMR. The absolute configurations of two diastereomers 2 and 3 and the enantiomers (- 5 ) and (+ 5 ) were assigned by comparing their experimental and calculated ECD data, whereas the absolute configuration of 4 was proposed by analogy. Compound 1 showed moderate activity against methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Guo, Yaojie","Ding, Ling","Ghidinelli, Simone","Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","de la Cruz, Mercedes","Mackenzie, Thomas A.","Ramos, Maria C.","Sánchez, Pilar","Vicente, Francisca","Genilloud, Olga","Coriani, Sonia","Larsen, René Wugt","Frisvad, Jens Christian","Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-364437"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld"],"country":["Italy","Spain"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Fundación MEDINA","University of Brescia"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"taxonomy driven discovery of polyketides from i aspergillus californicus i","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85103329704","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-364437","identifier":[{"id":"85103329704","type"