{"abstract":"Microbial oxidation in a biofilter is a treatment solution for diluted landfill gas (LFG), for instance at old landfills, where LFG recovery is no longer feasible, or from remediation systems designed to cut off laterally migrating LFG. In this study, an actively loaded open-bed compost filter, designed for the treatment of diluted LFG, was tested at an old landfill in Denmark. An 18 m3 biofilter was constructed in a 30 m3 container loaded with LFG mixed with air, in order to obtain diluted LFG. The inlet concentration of methane (CH4) fluctuated between 4.4 and 9.2 vol% during the five tested flow campaigns, resulting in CH4 loads of 106–794 g CH4 m−2 d−1. The maximum identified CH4 oxidation rate was 460 g m−2 d−1, with an overall CH4 oxidation efficiency of 58%. Due to preferential flows, especially along the edges of the filter at the transition points between the compost and the container wall, an overall CH4 oxidation efficiency of 100% was never achieved. However, pore gas profiles in selected areas in the filter material showed oxidation efficiencies close to 100%. The results were supported by tracer gas tests showing average oxidation efficiency in the nine measuring points of 89% at a CH4 load of 487 ± 64 g CH4 m−2 d−1.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Fjelsted, Lotte","Scheutz, Charlotte","Christensen, A. G.","Larsen, J. E.","Kjeldsen, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-351703"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Fjelsted, Lotte"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-NIRA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-NIRA","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"biofiltration of diluted landfill gas in an active loaded open bed compost filter","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/219908726/Second_Revised_paper_CLEAN.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-351703","identifier":[{"id":"31862629","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85076425197","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-9e05b06f-e72f-4081-a585-3b984cff01a2"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-56357F325CABD33699847E4673D7D511"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/219908726/Second_Revised_paper_CLEAN.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Environmental Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Environmental Engineering, Residual Resource Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"niras","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-NIRA","l3nl":"NIRAS A/S","l3nn":"NIRAS","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"NIRAS","namevar":["NIRAS A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-NIRA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lotte","key":"fjelstedpau","last":"Fjelsted","locid":"66fc8252-3482-4d08-99ce-6f5ee964650f","name":"Fjelsted, Lotte","orcid":"0000-0002-2878-798X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"scheutzpau","last":"Scheutz","locid":"48fe2850-fdc6-4282-9b97-ac5773419e5c","name":"Scheutz, Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-2218-5934","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"A. G.","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, A. G.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"J. E.","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, J. E.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"kjeldsenpau","last":"Kjeldsen","locid":"49899b92-45e7-485d-88cb-faf95e4ac0d7","name":"Kjeldsen, Peter","orcid":"0000-0003-2738-9960","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31862629"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.wasman.2019.12.005","issn":["0956053X","18792456"],"issn_org":["0956053X"],"journal":"Waste Management","pages":"1-11","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Waste Management","volume":"103"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85076425197"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","NIRAS A/S","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-9e05b06f-e72f-4081-a585-3b984cff01a2"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Biofiltration of diluted landfill gas in an active loaded open-bed compost filter","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-351703","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"The home is often conceptualised as a place of shelter and privacy, a place for socialising with family and friends, and where key events are shared. Thus, the home can also be a site for caregiving and care receipt. The demographic, economic and technological development in the welfare state of Demark has led to the transfer of care from hospitals to private homes. This change may affect the relative’s life and the relationship between the patient and relatives. This study examines how close relatives experience treatment and caregiving in their private homes.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Skouenborg, Pernille Bak","Eckhardt, Charlotte Michala","Jensen, Gitte Sylvester","Lyng Larsen, Karen","Dybbro, Karina Løvendahl","Højgaard, Kristina","Hoeck, Bente","Delmar, Charlotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-651921"],"event":{"end":"2020-08-28","place":"Göteborg , se","start":"2020-08-26","title":"The 24th International Philosophy of Nursing Conference IPONS","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Everyday life","Nursing"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-NDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-NDR","DI-U-AU","DI-UC-UCN","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"relatives experiences and role when treatment and caregiving enters home","src":["ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-651921","ids":["ucn-aea27b9e-6de7-4e91-be4b-44d7be08a8cb"],"keyword":["everyday life","nursing"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C255317A6109017B972080514B5D1108"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA University College"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"north denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-NDR","l3nl":"North Denmark Region","l3nn":"North Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"North Denmark Region","namevar":["Regionshospital Nordjylland"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-NDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN Velfærd, Sygeplejerskeuddannelsen Aalborg"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pernille Bak","key":"skouenborgpau","last":"Skouenborg","name":"Skouenborg, Pernille Bak","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte Michala","key":"eckhardtpau","last":"Eckhardt","name":"Eckhardt, Charlotte Michala","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Gitte Sylvester","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Gitte Sylvester","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen","key":"lynglarsenpau","last":"Lyng Larsen","name":"Lyng Larsen, Karen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Karina Løvendahl","key":"dybbropau","last":"Dybbro","name":"Dybbro, Karina Løvendahl","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristina","key":"højgaardpau","last":"Højgaard","locid":"c600ce8f-7798-45f2-b3ec-b00fd0c141c3","name":"Højgaard, Kristina","orcid":"0000-0001-5419-0346","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Bente","key":"hoeckpau","last":"Hoeck","name":"Hoeck, Bente","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"delmarpau","last":"Delmar","name":"Delmar, Charlotte","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Universities","University College of Northern Denmark","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucn-aea27b9e-6de7-4e91-be4b-44d7be08a8cb"],"src":["UCN University College of Northern Denmark"],"title":"Relatives’ experiences and role - when treatment and caregiving enters home","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-651921","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"The ever-changing development of digital technologies and digital infrastructure makes it necessary for us as researchers to change approaches to digital research within the humanities. In terms of research ethics, we can no longer use traditional laws and guidelines that only match the non-digital world. In a time where it is necessary to change and re-think our ways of doing research, we bring to you this second version of Ethical Challenges in Digital Research to initiate discussions about ethical research and to help guide you in your digital research. The compound may serve you as a guideline to ethical research, a helpful tool to those in need of inspiration or merely as a list of literature that is relevant to your field, whether that is: big data, surveillance, privacy, games and gamification, ethics in studies with children and adolescents, health research, journalism, ethnographic studies, visual methods, vulnerable groups, web archives, economy, risky business for researchers or one of the many other categories in this collection of ethical digital research.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Christensen, Line Lisberg","Larsen, Malene Charlotte","Wind, Sanne Tarp"],"cuid":["S02-083.04-006423"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ethical challenges in digital research a guide to discuss ethical issues in digital research second edition","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dighumlab.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/Ethical_challenges_in_digital-research.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-083.04-006423","ids":["aau-84b9d8e5-a363-420d-9ac8-701f122adefd","aau-f7633b9c-0739-4952-95a7-b616a5d2690c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-F19A7E5DEEDA0936527DF79C37A01625"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dighumlab.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/Ethical_challenges_in_digital-research.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, E-learning lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Line Lisberg","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"779d079a-0498-4467-a485-b354344b6eb1","name":"Christensen, Line Lisberg","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Malene Charlotte","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"cc0033d3-6794-4e0c-b451-939e05f9a1ee","name":"Larsen, Malene Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-4821-5855","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Sanne Tarp","key":"windpau","last":"Wind","locid":"f737ff9e-90fe-483e-b1da-86f5a83a3813","name":"Wind, Sanne Tarp","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"136","place":"Aalborg Universitet, Digetik, DigHumLab.","status":"p","volume":"1."},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-84b9d8e5-a363-420d-9ac8-701f122adefd","aau-f7633b9c-0739-4952-95a7-b616a5d2690c"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Ethical Challenges in Digital Research : A guide to discuss ethical issues in digital research, Second edition","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-083.04-006423","year":2020,"yearsub":2020}
{"abstract":"Background Immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) have become a cornerstone in the treatment of advanced non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC). In the pivotal Keynote-024 study with highly selected patients, pembrolizumab improved survival compared with platinum-based chemotherapy (CT) in patients with a PD-L1 tumor proportion score ≥50% (median overall survival (mOS) 26.3 months and 1-year survival 70%) and treatment-related adverse events were less frequent compared to CT. Recent real-world studies show comparable results with the exception of patients with poor performance status (PS). Methods Data were collected retrospectively from consecutive patients treated in first-line with ICI from March 2017 to October 2018 in a nationwide oncology study. Clinical data included gender, age, smoking status, ECOG PS, TNM stage, histology, metastatic sites, comorbidity and reasons for treatment cessation and adverse events that caused hospitalization or death. Overall survival was assessed using Kaplan-Meier estimates and the association to clinical features determined by a multivariate Cox’s proportional hazards regression model. Results A total of 578 stage III-IV NSCLC patients were included. Median age was 69.8 years (range 45 – 88) and 43% were male. Tumors were predominantly adenocarcinomas (71%), and 82% of patients had stage IV disease. At baseline metastases to the brain, bones, and liver were observed in 7%, 28% and 11% of patients, respectively. Fifteen percent of patients had PS ≥2. Median OS was 19.6 months (95%CI 16.6-23.6), and estimated 1-year survival was 63.7%. In the multivariate analysis, patients with PS ≥2 (HR 1.7; 95%CI 1.2-2.3; P=0.002), bone metastases (HR 1.8; 95%CI 1.4-2.4; P=0.00) and liver metastases (HR 1.5; 95%CI 1.1-2.2; P=0.02) had a significantly worse prognosis. Age ≥75 years, sex, smoking status, histology, and Charlson Comorbidity Index Score were not significantly associated with OS. Conclusions A slightly poorer mOS and 1-year survival of real-world NSCLC patients compared to randomized trials was explained primarily by treatment of patients with PS ≥2 and metastases to the liver and bones. Age ≥75 years was not associated with a poor outcome.","author_count":24,"contributors":["Mouritzen, Mette Thune","Bjoernhart, B.","Poehl, M.","Ladekarl, Morten","Vesteghem, Charles","Bøgsted, Martin","Nielsen, A.W. Moelby","Meldgaard, P.","Hansen, K.H.","Larsen, J.W.W.","Kristiansen, C.","Wedervang, K.","Bareid-Oestby, A-C.","Frank, M.S.","Persson, G.","Kristensen, E.B.","Homann, P.H.","Carus, Andreas"],"cuid":["S02-083.88-003740"],"event":{"end":"2020-09-21","place":"Virtual","start":"2020-09-19","title":"ESMO Virtual Congress 2020","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"real word experience with first line immunotherapy in advanced non small cell lung cancer patients in a danish nationwide cohort","src":["aau","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-083.88-003740","ids":["aau-4c9dbe1d-68f1-4c67-bb9c-af0e8f9ea219","sdu-efb6905f-64ae-4d19-9ef2-e1ef92d2d004"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7BA9111F497EFB9A19198DC7447F8D7E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalb