of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, External Centres, Det Kgl. Bibliotek - Universitetsbibliotekarens ledelsessekretariat"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte","key":"wienpau","last":"Wien","locid":"277f8354-05c4-44a4-b3b9-df9d557c9028","name":"Wien, Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0002-3257-2084","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Asger Væring","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"fd7856d4-9391-4ae2-9349-f9181309b577","name":"Larsen, Asger Væring","orcid":"0000-0002-9967-2637","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01064142","09057633"],"issn_org":["01064142"],"newspaper":"Weekendavisen","publisher":"Berlingske Media AS","publisher_org":"Berlingske Media A/S","status":"p","title":"Weekendavisen","volume":"33"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-1de1336f-6b8b-45fa-a80c-7976df429492","sdu-b5dcaa5b-03c3-4706-8045-8a3947cc66e0"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Adgang for alle : Vrøvl. Tvivlsomme tidsskrifter udgiver hvad som helst for et mindre beløb. Det kan friste desperate forskere, der føler sig presset til at publicere. Men det er skidt for videnskaben.","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-091.67-756220","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Denne sanitary survey vurderer de potentielle mikrobiologiske forureningskilder, der kan have betydning for muslingeproduktionen i området Hesselø Bugt og Isefjord, som er underopdelt i seks produktionsområder, der er vurderet hver for sig. Bakterien E. coli er anvendt som indikator for mikrobiologisk forurening. I en række appendikser er potentielle kilder til mikrobiologisk forurening beskrevet samt muligheden for spredning eller nedbrydning af eventuel forurening ud fra de fysiske forhold i området. Hvert appendiks afsluttes med en kort konklusion. Datagrundlaget anvendt i rapporten er offentligt tilgængelige data og omfatter statistiske kilder for husdyr, landbrug, datakilder fra tilgrænsende kommuner samt data fra muslingefiskeriets egenkontrol og myndighedernes verifikation af denne. Det konkluderes i rapporten, at datasættet for E. coli-forekomster i muslinger m.m. i perioden 2009-2018 afspejler en ujævn fordeling af prøveudtagninger fra de forskellige produktionsområder i området Hesselø Bugt og Isefjord. Således opnår kun et af produktionsområderne permanent klassificering, mens de øvrige enten har for få data eller ikke har været aktive inden for det seneste år (2018). Resultaterne fra dataopgørelsen er dog generelt karakteriseret ved få forekomster af E. coli med relativt få påvisninger i kritiske koncentrationer. Rapporten indeholder forslag til en prøvetagningsplan, som tager udgangspunkt i EU’s retningslinjer for monitorering af mikrobiologisk forurening af muslinger m.m.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Larsen, Martin Mørk","Jakobsen, Hans","Göke, Cordula","Hendriksen, Niels Bohse","Koefoed Rømer, Jonas","Mohn, Christian","Jensen, Annette Nygaard","Schultz, Anna Charlotte"],"cuid":["S02-092.19-013128"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["E coli","Fiskeri","Mikrobiologisk forurening","Muslinger","Sanitary survey","Toskallede bløddyr"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sanitary survey rapport 000000000009 hesselø bugt og isefjord","src":["au","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/195355668/TR147.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-092.19-013128","ids":["au-074f4ae1-e42b-4b8a-abe1-adfc1387f16c","dtu-71809dbe-632e-44a5-aec1-1c6e7ce47c32"],"keyword":["E. coli","Hesselø Bugt","Isefjord","fiskeri","mikrobiologisk forurening","muslinger","sanitary survey","toskallede bløddyr"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-CDD71B6DA5B5506DD74CF870C82D7B67"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://dce2.au.dk/pub/TR147.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/TR147.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/195355668/TR147.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Marine Diversity and Experimental Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute, Research Group for Food Microbiology and Hygiene"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin Mørk","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"d24cdbff-3543-4170-b95f-c315ce7477bb","name":"Larsen, Martin Mørk","orcid":"0000-0003-4331-8548","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans","key":"jakobsenpau","last":"Jakobsen","locid":"115e2890-be07-49a8-a340-d271dd22ac2b","name":"Jakobsen, Hans","orcid":"0000-0001-9590-2362","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Cordula","key":"gökepau","last":"Göke","locid":"203ca293-fd97-4b16-8eba-24b61d042e20","name":"Göke, Cordula","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Bohse","key":"hendriksenpau","last":"Hendriksen","locid":"50fd9962-24ef-4560-9838-1bb6da39e607","name":"Hendriksen, Niels Bohse","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jonas","key":"koefoedrømerpau","last":"Koefoed Rømer","locid":"02a85068-d9f1-4a76-a2f6-b5751937ada4","name":"Koefoed Rømer, Jonas","orcid":"0000-0002-8895-2529","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"mohnpau","last":"Mohn","locid":"3249f637-7852-40ab-b6ac-1b8670bcd9c9","name":"Mohn, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-4331-1365","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Annette Nygaard","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"45d88d2c-4bbc-4adf-8822-a0ddb19bbda6","name":"Jensen, Annette Nygaard","orcid":"0000-0001-9681-7258","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anna Charlotte","key":"schultzpau","last":"Schultz","locid":"3a3d5130-acf6-4846-93e3-f3b891d83e60","name":"Schultz, Anna Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-1484-9120","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["2244999X"],"issue":"147","pages":"118","publisher":"Aarhus Universitet, DCE - Nationalt Center for Miljø og Energi ©","publisher_org":"Aarhus Universitet, DCE – Nationalt Center for Miljø og Energi ©","repno":"Aarhus Universitet. Nationalt Center for Miljo og Energi. Teknisk Rapport, No. 147","series":"Aarhus Universitet. Nationalt Center for Miljo og Energi. Teknisk Rapport","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-074f4ae1-e42b-4b8a-abe1-adfc1387f16c","dtu-71809dbe-632e-44a5-aec1-1c6e7ce47c32"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Sanitary survey rapport 9: Hesselø Bugt og Isefjord","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-092.19-013128","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Background âThe post-colonoscopy colorectal cancer (PCCRC) rate is a key quality indicator for colonoscopy. Previously published PCCRC rates have been difficult to compare owing to differences in methodology. The primary aim of this study was to compare Danish PCCRC rates internationally and to calculate Danish PCCRC rates using the World Endoscopy Organization (WEO) consensus method for future comparison. The secondary aim was to identify factors associated with PCCRC. Methods âNational registries were used to examine the risk of PCCRC. The Danish 3-year rate of PCCRC (PCCRC-3yr) was calculated using previously published methods from England, Sweden, and the WEO. Poisson regression analysis was performed to identify factors associated with PCCRC. Results âThe Danish PCCRC-3yr was significantly higher than the rate in the English NHS (relative risk [RR] 1.12, 95% confidence interval [CI] 1.05-1.19) and Sweden (RR 1.15, 95%CI 1.06-1.24). The Danish PCCRC-3yr based on the WEO consensus method fell from 22.5% in 2001 to 7.9% in 2012. The multivariable Poisson regression model found PCCRC to be significantly associated with diverticulitis (RR 3.25, 95%CI 2.88-3.66), ulcerative colitis (RR 3.44, 95%CI 2.79-4.23), hereditary cancer (age < 60 years: RR 7.39, 95%CI 5.77-9.47; age ≥ 60 years: RR 3.81, 95%CI 2.74-5.31), and location in the transverse (RR 1.57, 95%CI 1.28-1.94) and ascending colon (RR 1.85, 95%CI 1.64-2.08). Conclusions âThe PCCRC-3yr was higher in Denmark than in comparable countries. Differences in colonoscopist training, background, and certification are possible contributing factors. A review of colonoscopist training and certification in Denmark, and continuous audit and feedback of colonoscopist performance may reduce PCCRC-3yr.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Pedersen, Lasse","Valori, Roland","Bernstein, Inge","Lindorff-Larsen, Karen","Green, Charlotte","Torp-Pedersen, Christian"],"cuid":["S02-099.58-005223"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Pedersen, Lasse"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Gloucestershire Hospitals NHS Foundation Trust"],"keyword":["Diverticulosis","Interval","Predictors","Quality","RATES"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"OT":["Department of Gastroenterology, Gloucestershire Hospitals, Gloucester, United Kingdom."],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"risk of post colonoscopy colorectal cancer in denmark time trends and comparison with sweden and the english national health service","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85069819202&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-099.58-005223","identifier":[{"id":"31174223","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85069819202","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000482275200025","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-6b9dd07a-711a-4e57-807b-de1d0ad8a7b3","au-9a03b282-5efd-450f-ac55-363dcbe5e414"],"keyword":["DIVERTICULOSIS","INTERVAL","PREDICTORS","QUALITY","RATES","VARY"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-508AC8FABAEA2A2452E1159A31CC2857"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg 