{"abstract":"Cyclopiamines C (1) and D (2) were isolated from the extract of Penicillium sp. CML 3020, a fungus sourced from an Atlantic Forest soil sample. Their structures and relative configuration were determined by 1D and 2D NMR, HRMS, and UV/vis data analysis. Cyclopiamines C and D belong to a small subset of rare spiroindolinone compounds containing an alkyl nitro group and a 4,5-dihydro-1H-pyrrolo[3,2,1-ij]quinoline-2,6-dione ring system. NMR and MS/HRMS data confirmed the presence of an epoxide unit (C-17-O-C-18) and a hydroxy group at C-5, not observed for their known congeners. Cytotoxic and antimicrobial activities were evaluated.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Kildgaard, Sara","de Medeiros, Lívia S","Phillips, Emma","Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","Frisvad, Jens Christian","Nielsen, Kristian Fog","Abreu, Lucas M.","Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-373910"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, South","Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld"],"country":["Brazil","Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","German Cancer Research Center","Universidade Federal de São Paulo","Universidade Federal de Viçosa"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cyclopiamines c and d epoxide spiroindolinone alkaloids from penicillium sp cml 000000003020","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85046007332","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-373910","identifier":[{"id":"29488766","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85046007332","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-e7e24ab5-36e3-4bcb-a25f-90dd0ea43323"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8A884C2DA7A9CE8B6624398D375D5306"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine, Section for Microbial and Chemical Ecology, Natural Product Discovery"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"br","key":"universidade federal de são paulo","loc":["Brazil","America, South"],"name":"Universidade Federal de São Paulo","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"german cancer research center","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"German Cancer Research Center","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"br","key":"universidade federal de viçosa","loc":["Brazil","America, South"],"name":"Universidade Federal de Viçosa","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sara","key":"kildgaardpau","last":"Kildgaard","locid":"e2aa7e75-5e6d-4dac-9b3f-c84affe68992","name":"Kildgaard, Sara","orcid":"0000-0003-3761-0382","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lívia S","key":"demedeirospau","last":"de Medeiros","name":"de Medeiros, Lívia S","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Emma","key":"phillipspau","last":"Phillips","name":"Phillips, Emma","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte H.","key":"gotfredsenpau","last":"Gotfredsen","locid":"1cf4df84-2d0e-4693-bf47-e9932e3bf0e3","name":"Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","name_org":"Gotfredsen, Charlotte H.","orcid":"0000-0002-7386-119X","rank