{"abstract":"This poster gives an overview of the ongoing Danish ForskEL/EUDP project “OffshoreWake” (2017 - 2020). The focal point of this project is to develop a calculation system that adds the large scale offshore wind farm wake (WFW) to the power system. There are five components in this calculation system, as shown in FIG 1, with 0, 1 and 2 already existing. OffshoreWake adds components 3 and 4, namely the WFW and surface wave conditions","author_count":12,"contributors":["Larsén, Xiaoli Guo","Volker, Patrick","Sørensen, Poul Ejnar","Nissen, Jesper","Du, Jianting","Giebel, Gregor","Ott, Søren","Hasager, Charlotte Bay","Maule, Petr","Hahmann, Andrea N.","Ahsbahs, Tobias Torben","Badger, Jake"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-341230"],"event":{"end":"2018-04-13","place":"Vienna, at","start":"2018-04-08","title":"European Geosciences Union General Assembly 2018","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Vattenfall"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"large scale offshore wake impact on the danish power system","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/150058245/EGU2018_Poster_OffshoreWake_20180405.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-341230","ids":["dtu-7ada8b54-fdbe-4393-8961-4b0962ba01c5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4EA541112B06D400211BE9FD26EF75C3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/150058245/EGU2018_Poster_OffshoreWake_20180405.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":