{"abstract":"Greenhouse gas emission data from the mineralisation process in Sludge Treatment Reed Bed systems (STRB) are scarce. The aim of this study was to quantify the emission rates of carbon dioxide (CO2), methane (CH4) and nitrous oxide (N2O) and to investigate seasonal variations in order to estimate the annual greenhouse gas emission rate of the mineralisation process. The full-scale STRB at Helsinge wastewater treatment plant (WWTP) in Denmark was chosen as the study site. Gas emission rates were measured using static surface flux chambers. The measurements were carried out in October/November 2014, March/April 2015, June/July 2015 and January/February 2016. We found that the emission rates of all included gas species were significantly affected by season. For CO2 and CH4, the highest emission rates were recorded in summer, being138 and 5.2 g m−2 d−1, respectively, while the lowest rates were recorded in winter, being 442 and 0.7 g m−2 d−1, respectively. For N2O, the highest and lowest rates were recorded in autumn and spring, being 0.47 and 0.31 g m−2 d−1, respectively. Emissions of CO2 and CH4 appeared to be affected by changes in temperature, while N2O appeared to be affected not only by temperature, but also by the amount of precipitation. An annual greenhouse gas emission rate (given in CO2 equivalents) of the mineralisation process was calculated for two scenarios based on the assumptions; 1) gas emission rates are not affected by the amount of sludge accumulated in the STRB and 2) gas emission rates are affected by the amount of sludge accumulated in the STRB. The results revealed that the annual global warming potential is to be found in a range between 7 and 13.4 kg CO2-eq·PE−1 y−1.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Julie Dam","Nielsen, Steen","Scheutz, Charlotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-361947"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Air Pollution Sources","Atmospheric Properties","Carbon dioxide","Environmental Impact and Protection","Environmental impact","Gas emissions","Gases","Global warming","Global warming potential","Greenhouse gases","Industrial Wastes Treatment","Inorganic Compounds","Methane","Mineralogy","Nitrogen oxides","Nitrous oxide","Organic compounds","Particulate emissions","Phragmites australis","Seasonal variation","Sewage sludge","Sewage treatment","Sludge treatment","Wastewater treatment","Wastewater treatment plants"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-WSP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-WSP","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"greenhouse gas emissions from the mineralisation process in a sludge treatment reed bed system seasonal variation and environmental impact","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85020410937","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-361947","identifier":[{"id":"85020410937","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-bffb2822-3ab8-495f-a08f-9615c9841d20"],"keyword":["Air Pollution Sources","Atmospheric Properties","Carbon dioxide","Emissions rates","Environmental Impact and Protection","Environmental impact","Gas emission rates","Gas emissions","Gases","Global warming","Global warming potential","Greenhouse gases","Industrial Wastes Treatment","Inorganic Compounds","Methane","Mineralogy","Nitrogen oxides","Nitrous oxide","Organic Compounds","Particulate emissions","Phragmites australis","Seasonal variation","Sewage Treatment","Sewage sludge","Sludge treatment","Wastewater treatment","Wastewater treatment plants"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5A2C52EF4A425BDE12895B68A346AF86"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Environmental Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Environmental Engineering, Residual Resource Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"wsp danmark","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-WSP","l3nl":"WSP Danmark A/S","l3nn":"WSP Danmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"WSP Danmark","namevar":["Orbicon"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-WSP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Julie Dam","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"96983a7c-0a55-45a8-a10e-759b599e33a3","name":"Larsen, Julie Dam","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Steen","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Steen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"scheutzpau","last":"Scheutz","locid":"48fe2850-fdc6-4282-9b97-ac5773419e5c","name":"Scheutz, Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-2218-5934","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ecoleng.2017.05.053","issn":["09258574","18726992"],"issn_org":["09258574"],"journal":"Ecological Engineering","pages":"279-286","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Ecological Engineering","volume":"106"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85020410937"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","WSP Danmark A/S"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-bffb2822-3ab8-495f-a08f-9615c9841d20"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Greenhouse gas emissions from the mineralisation process in a Sludge Treatment Reed Bed system: Seasonal variation and environmental impact","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-361947","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"I denne rapport bringes resultaterne af undersøgelsen: ”Et signalement af specialpædagogisk faglighed – en undersøgelse af pædagogers varetagelse af specialpædagogiske opgaver.” Der er knyttet betydelige strategiske interesser til begrebet specialpædagogik – både økonomiske, styringsmæssige og fagpolitiske - da det er et velfærdsområde, der tildeles mange samfundsmæssige resurser. Både i den politiske debat, i kommunale forvaltninger og blandt pædagoger og andre fagprofessionelle er det karakteristisk, at begrebet specialpædagogik og dets praksisformer anvendes i mange forskellige betydninger og sammenhænge. Ikke mindst synes titlen ”specialpædagog” at dække over mange typer af opgaver og funktioner. Baggrunden for undersøgelsen er således et udtalt behov for: •at få en oversigt over specialpædagogisk virksomhed i dens forskellige organisatoriske former, som den udøves af pædagoger i dagtilbud, skoler/SFO, fritid og klub samt på det forebyggende og dagbehandlende område (familieområdet) •at skabe indsigt i opgaver, målgrupper og organisatoriske rammer i specialpædagogiske indsatser for børn og unge med særlige behov samt udsatte familier •at give en karakteristik af specialpædagogisk faglighed","author_count":5,"contributors":["Nielsen, Ole Steen","Madsen, Bent Lund","Overgaard Larsen, Doris","Quvang, Christian","Brønsted, Charlotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-654714"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Børn og unge","Pædagogers faglighed","Specialpædagogik"],"level":"sci","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-UC"],"level3":{"OT":["Inklusionsakademiet"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCS"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCS"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"signalement af specialpædagogisk faglighed","src":["ucsyd"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCS"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://bupl.dk/signalement","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-654714","ids":["ucsyd-efa14988-1fb8-4cbe-8bf7-7d4fc26619ef"],"keyword":["Børn og unge","pædagogers faglighed","specialpædagogik"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-6C7C4E26950103CD8B82234A2D5576BC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.ucsyd.dk/ws/files/42442480/FIN_BUPL_rapport_om_specialp_dagogik_9.6.17_ny_off._version_.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://bupl.dk/signalement","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"uc syd university college south denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCS","l3nl":"UC SYD, University College South Denmark","l3nn":"UC SYD University College South Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UC SYD University College South Denmark","namevar":["UC SYD"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCS","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Inklusionsakademiet"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole Steen","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"e2d4c505-ac65-4d9b-bc67-87c9840e9ed3","name":"Nielsen, Ole Steen","orcid":"0000-0002-4565-5882","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bent Lund","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","name":"Madsen, Bent Lund","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Doris","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"81cb3d78-4b9d-4045-8f07-1acc5948e257","name":"Overgaard Larsen, Doris","name_org":"Larsen, Doris","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"quvangpau","last":"Quvang","locid":"c9c28d15-898e-4060-819f-be6bc977d5fd","name":"Quvang, Christian","orcid":"0000-0003-2257-2942","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"brønstedpau","last":"Brønsted","name":"Brønsted, Charlotte","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"110","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","UC SYD, University College South Denmark","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucsyd-efa14988-1fb8-4cbe-8bf7-7d4fc26619ef"],"src":["UC SYD University College South Denmark"],"title":"Signalement af specialpædagogisk faglighed","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-654714","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
