{"abstract":"Based on empirical data we in this paper explore day-to-day strategising with an emphasis on phronesis. This way we shed some light on the nearly silent, quiet, indirect strategic change processes as they are practiced and reflected upon by leaders in small companies in their daily practice and in conversations with each other and with us.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Mette Vinther","Madsen, Charlotte Øland","Rasmussen, Jørgen Gulddahl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-096381"],"event":{"end":"2016-07-09","place":"Naples, it","start":"2016-07-07","title":"EGOS Colloquium","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Phronesis","Strategi","kommunikation meningsskabelse relationer"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"silent indirect strategic processes in small and medium sized enterprises","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/245958274/EGOS_full_paper_theme_20_Larsen_Madsen_Rasmussen_2016.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-096381","ids":["aau-9fde77e0-1b77-4a8a-8edf-9d0bfca81be3"],"keyword":["kommunikation, meningsskabelse, relationer","phronesis","strategi"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-88D3DB61C7CEE97680E36828A2A7F72E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/245958274/EGOS_full_paper_theme_20_Larsen_Madsen_Rasmussen_2016.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy, Centre for Learning in Organisations","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Business and Management","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Business and Management, Firms, Innovation and Relations Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mette Vinther","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"0de85dc7-1bbc-4121-81f7-05c927f84a51","name":"Larsen, Mette Vinther","orcid":"0000-0002-4966-8090","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Øland","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"22026f1a-b034-403c-90cb-f6bc643a2f49","name":"Madsen, Charlotte Øland","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jørgen Gulddahl","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"1a9b8010-beeb-47cc-8dc4-319dc6973fe7","name":"Rasmussen, Jørgen Gulddahl","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-9fde77e0-1b77-4a8a-8edf-9d0bfca81be3"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Silent, indirect strategic processes in small and medium sized enterprises","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-096381","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"This chapter examines the concept of identity in relation to youth practices on social network sites (SNSs). The chapter illustrates how writing “I love you” or other emotional statements on each other’s profiles on SNSs is not only a common way for Danish teenagers to communicate and practice friendship, but also an important part of their self-presentation online. It examines why these emotional statements are almost always publicly available – or even strategically and intentionally placed on the young people’s profiles. In relation to this, it is argued that young people – through their emotional communicative actions – are not only staging their own identity, but are co-constructors of each other’s identities, which the author characterises as an “open source”, networked identity.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Larsen, Malene Charlotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-097188"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an open source networked identity on young people s construction and co construction of identity on social network sites","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.springer.com/gp/book/9783319278919","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-097188","identifier":[{"id":"84978274894","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-a2b56508-c97a-4070-b0d7-529ec285364a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BDE7786FB23108C5C63368084FBAD779"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Mattering: Centre for Discourse & Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Malene Charlotte","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"cc0033d3-6794-4e0c-b451-939e05f9a1ee","name":"Larsen, Malene Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-4821-5855","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Michel","key":"walravepedh","last":"Walrave","name":"Walrave, Michel","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Koen","key":"ponnetpedh","last":"Ponnet","name":"Ponnet, Koen","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ellen","key":"vanderhovenpedh","last":"Vanderhoven","name":"Vanderhoven, Ellen","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jacques","key":"haerspedh","last":"Haers","name":"Haers, Jacques","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Barbara","key":"segaertpedh","last":"Segaert","name":"Segaert, Barbara","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-27893-3_2","edition":"1","eisbn":["9783319278933"],"isbn":["9783319278919"],"pages":"21-39","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","subtitle":"Connecting, Sharing and Empowering","title":"Youth 2.0: Social Media and Adolescence","volume":"1"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84978274894"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-a2b56508-c97a-4070-b0d7-529ec285364a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"An 'open source' networked identity. : On young people's construction and co-construction of identity on social network sites","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-097188","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"SEGES Videncenter for Svineproduktion har undersøgt, om det er muligt at opnå den samme udvikling i antistoffer i grise, der var dobbelt-vaccineret med MLV-vaccine mod både PRRSV Type 1 og Type 2 samtidig, sammenlignet med grise, der kun havde fået den ene af vaccinerne. Ud fra forsøget kan vi konkludere, at det er muligt at vaccinere med begge PRRS vacciner på samme tid og opnå antistofsvar for begge typer PRRSV. Husk dog altid at give forskellige vacciner i hver sin side af nakken. Blodprøver fra grisene viste, at de havde dannet antistoffer og blev positive i ELISA-testen for PRRSV Type 1 21-35 dage og PRRSV Type 2 6-14 dage efter vaccination. I IPT-testen testede grisene positive 6-14 dage efter vaccination. Den østeuropæiske PRRSV Type 1 subtype 2 (PRRSV Type Øst), som 1/3 af grisene blev podet med, gav ligeledes anledning til antistofudvikling, der kunne måles i både ELISA-EU og ELISA-US samt IPT testene. Disse tests kan dog ikke skelne ”eksotiske” PRRSV subtyper fra de almindelige cirkulerende PRRSV subtyper i Danmark. Forsøget blev gennemført på Lindholm. Der indgik 66 grise fra en Blå SPF+Ap6+Ap12 besætning. Grisene blev ved ankomst fordelt i 4 grupper (VAC-T1, VAC-T2, VAC-T1T2 og NON-VAC): VAC-T1 blev vaccineret med Porcilis ® PRRS VET VAC-T2 blev vaccineret med Ingelvac ® PRRS VET VAC-T1T2 fik begge vacciner samtidig i hver sin side af nakken NON-VAC blev ikke vaccineret. Grisene blev gennem hele forsøget observeret dagligt. De fik taget temperatur den første uge efter vaccination og blodprøver på dag -1, 1, 2, 5, 6, 14, 21, 35, 42, 49 og 62 efter vaccination. NON-VAC fik kun taget blodprøver på dag -1 og 62 efter vaccination. 62 dage efter vaccination blev alle grise blandet og inddelt i 3 nye grupper, som var separat opstaldet i 6 forsøgsstalde. I hver forsøgsstald blev grisene dag 63 podet via næsen med PRRSV, som enten var PRRSV Type 1 (subtype 1), PRRSV Type Øst (Type 1 subtype 2, findes ikke i Danmark) eller PRRSV Type 2. Der blev taget temperatur den første uge efter og blodprøver fra alle grise på dag 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 9 og 13 efter podning. Dag 13/14 efter podning blev alle grise aflivet og obduceret. Blodprøver fra alle vaccinerede grise viste, at de havde dannet antistoffer og blev positive i ELISA PRRSV Type 1 testen 21-49 dage efter vaccination og i PRRSV Type 2 testen 14-35 dage efter vaccination. I IPT-testen var 40-80 % af grisene blevet positive 14 dage efter vaccination. Efter podning med 3 forskellige PRRSV sås den samme udvikling i antistoffer uafhængigt af, om grisen havde fået én eller to vacciner. Blodprøver fra ikke-vaccinerede grise viste, at de havde dannet antistoffer og blev positive 5-9 dage efter podning i både ELISA-testen og IPT-testen.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Sonne Kristensen, Charlotte","Qvist Pawlowski, Mia","Thoning, Henrik","Haugegaard, Svend","Holmgaard Carlsen, Sif","Lauritsen, Klara Tølbøl","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Larsen, Lars Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-333201"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"udvikling af antistoffer efter vaccination mod og podning med prrsv meddelelser nr 000000001067","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/127569607/Meddelelse_1067.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-333201","ids":["dtu-6029c69b-c292-48d6-a9dc-6bd1ee1516fc"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-FE937122BD22140837E2D1C916B338FC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://vsp.lf.dk/Publikationer/Kilder/lu_medd/2016/1067.aspx","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc