{"author_count":9,"contributors":["Aamann, Iben Charlotte","Liveng, Anne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-564858"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Diskurs","Forældreskab","Klasse","Kulturteori","Sundhed","overvægtige børn"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hun venter på at det kommer klasse mellem linjerne i dokumenter om tidlig opsporing af overvægt","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-564858","ids":["ruc-84286ee1-5d17-4a7f-8755-4ceacb76a02b"],"keyword":["diskurs","forældreskab","klasse","kulturteori","overvægtige børn","sundhed"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-581482C7E0BFE05D1E71D5AD04A361D2"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Iben Charlotte","key":"aamannpau","last":"Aamann","locid":"e9929153-ac32-4969-ba78-9a893db7adf4","name":"Aamann, Iben Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0001-7578-5568","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Anne","key":"livengpau","last":"Liveng","locid":"e4478baa-0741-4db7-904c-9994ba4a7fd9","name":"Liveng, Anne","orcid":"0000-0001-5920-3492","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sine","key":"lehnpedh","last":"Lehn","name":"Lehn, Sine","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Anne","key":"livengpedh","last":"Liveng","name":"Liveng, Anne","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Betina","key":"dybbroepedh","last":"Dybbroe","name":"Dybbroe, Betina","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mari","key":"holenpedh","last":"Holen","name":"Holen, Mari","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Nicole","key":"thualagantpedh","last":"Thualagant","name":"Thualagant, Nicole","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Kevin","key":"mogensenpedh","last":"Mogensen","name":"Mogensen, Kevin","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Birgitta","key":"nordenhoflarsenpedh","last":"Nordenhof Larsen","name":"Nordenhof Larsen, Birgitta","rank":9,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"issue":"1","pages":"97-120","place":"Frederiksberg","publisher":"Frydenlund Academic","series":"Sundhed, Samfund og Kultur","status":"p","subtitle":"Nye humanistiske og samfundsvidenskabelige perspektiver","title":"Ulighed i sundhed"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-84286ee1-5d17-4a7f-8755-4ceacb76a02b"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"\"Hun venter på, at det kommer\" : klasse mellem linjerne i dokumenter om tidlig opsporing af overvægt","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-564858","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Meniscal lesions are common and may contribute to the development of knee arthrosis. A few case-control and cross-sectional studies have identified knee-straining work as risk factors for meniscal lesions, but exposure-response relations and the role of specific exposures are uncertain, and previous results may be sensitive to reporting and selection bias. We examined the relation between meniscal lesions and cumulative exposure to heavy lifting in a prospective register-based study with complete follow-up and independent information on exposure and outcome. We established a cohort of unskilled men employed at Copenhagen Airport or in other companies in the metropolitan Copenhagen area from 1990 to 2012 (the Copenhagen Airport Cohort). The cohort at risk included 3,307 airport baggage handlers with heavy lifting and kneeling or squatting work tasks and 63,934 referents with a similar socioeconomic background and less knee-straining work. Baggage handlers lifted suitcases with an average weight of approximately 15 kg, in total approximately five tonnes during a 9-hour workday. The cohort was followed in the National Patient Register and Civil Registration System. The outcome was a first time hospital diagnosis or surgery of a meniscal lesion. Baggage handlers had a higher incidence of meniscal lesions than the referents. Within baggage handlers spline regression showed that the incidence rate ratio was 1.91 (95% confidence interval: 1.29-2.84) after five years as a baggage handler and then decreased slowly to reach unity after approximately 30 years, adjusted for effects of potential confounders. This relation between baggage handling and meniscal lesions was present for work on the apron which involves lifting in a kneeling or squatting position, but not in the baggage hall, which only involves lifting in standing positions. The results support that long-term heavy lifting in a kneeling or squatting position is a risk factor for the development of symptomatic meniscal lesions.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Mikkelsen, Sigurd","Brauer, Charlotte","Pedersen, Ellen Bøtker","Alkjær, Tine","Baldvinsson, Henrik Koblauch","Simonsen, Erik B","Helweg-Larsen, Karin","Thygesen, Lau Caspar"],"cuid":["S02-084.68-666766"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a cohort study on meniscal lesions among airport baggage handlers","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0157336","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-084.68-666766","identifier":[{"id":"PMC4907513","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"27299861","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84976286542","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-08979680-79b4-441b-b918-db88468ad175","sdu-563ab223-f2a6-443f-9725-3c3e199c0b99"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-8CBB51906B639C274DA6F8C6688763EA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0157336","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/123038410/journal.pone.0157336.PDF","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/167921412/3682936.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Hvidovre Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Public Health, Section of Environmental Health"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, National Institute of Public Health, Research Programme on Health and Morbidity in Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sigurd","key":"mikkelsenpau","last":"Mikkelsen","name":"Mikkelsen, Sigurd","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"brauerpau","last":"Brauer","name":"Brauer, Charlotte","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Ellen Bøtker","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"490c0139-0882-445e-a0e1-3990a9e12ceb","name":"Pedersen, Ellen Bøtker","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Tine","key":"alkjærpau","last":"Alkjær","locid":"d0ff1f22-b755-48d5-b5c9-94a9ef4367ac","name":"Alkjær, Tine","orcid":"0000-0002-9105-3882","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Henrik Koblauch","key":"baldvinssonpau","last":"Baldvinsson","locid":"51f1498f-8f12-4131-893c-2710ab7e2eea","name":"Baldvinsson, Henrik Koblauch","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":