,"volume":"39"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84994791379"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e34a5116-a201-4444-9508-5cdc60601c71","au-390aa2a0-c996-45d2-b0b6-040461bc45e9","sdu-4c0e6902-65bf-4ee6-b4ce-cb528eb5a285"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Study Design and Cohort Description of DEFIB-WOMEN : A National Danish Study in Patients with an ICD","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-097.96-010856","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"The purpose of this work is to investigate a method of measuring emotional experience by interrupting video content every three minutes to self-report. We let 16 test participants watch the short-film Helium divided into a control group and an intervention group. The subjective experiences from nine subjects (the intervention group) were captured by self-reporting via the widely used SAM pictogram scale. The intervention group was interrupted every three minutes for this. We found that interruptions induced by the self-reporting approach have negative effects on the subjects’ experience. This is observed in the biometric GSR data, which shows a clear correlation between GSR measures and the interruptions, showing an average of 30 seconds to return to “normal” after interruptions. The intervention group’s experience evaluation of the video content also support this effect, showing statistical evidence of a reduced experience when using the method of interruptions","author_count":6,"contributors":["Jensen, Charlotte Thodberg","Jessen, Anne Mette Karnøe","Jørgensen, Lotte Ishoy","Laursen, Jeanette Kølbæk","Larsen, Lars Bo","Lyng Wieland, Jakob"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-052141"],"event":{"end":"2016-07-31","place":"Florida , us","start":"2016-07-27","title":"AHFE 2016 International Conference on Affective and Pleasurable Design","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Danmarks Radio"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"using biometric data to assess affective response to media experiences","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.springer.com/us/book/9783319416601","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-052141","identifier":[{"id":"84986281463","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-074e072d-169e-44ac-b455-3d9c2216693a"],"keyword":["Emotions · Core affect · Arousal · Valence · Biometrics ·Skin conductance · Galvanic Skin Response (GSR) · Self-reporting · SAM · Media research"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E8F1ABC2A3FAAA21F70211EF03212B8A"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Danmarks Radio"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Thodberg","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"adc3b813-9e0e-4d97-b35b-4d1199ed57c4","name":"Jensen, Charlotte Thodberg","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anne Mette Karnøe","key":"jessenpau","last":"Jessen","locid":"950393a4-7515-4c14-84dc-400ec9cb7ea7","name":"Jessen, Anne Mette Karnøe","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lotte Ishoy","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"d8a45a67-e7ea-41b8-bb01-69d97b98639c","name":"Jørgensen, Lotte Ishoy","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jeanette Kølbæk","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laurs