{"abstract":"User-generated information types (ratings and reviews) are highly used when booking hotel rooms on Online Travel Agency (OTA) websites. The impact of user-generated information on decision-making is often investigated through quantitative research, thereby not examining in depth how and why travelers use this information. This paper therefore presents a qualitative study conducted to achieve a deeper understanding. We investigated the use of reviews and average rating in a hotel-booking-context through a laboratory experiment, which involved a task of examining a hotel on a pre-designed OTA website followed by an interview. We processed the data from the interview, and the analysis resulted in a model generalizing the use of reviews and average rating in the deliberation phase of a hotel-booking. The findings are overall consistent with related research. Yet, beyond this, the qualitative approach has given some deep insights that expand the knowledge in the field.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Buus, Line Thomassen","Jensen, Charlotte Thodberg","Jessen, Anne Mette Karnøe","Jørgensen, Lotte Ishoy","Laursen, Jeanette Kølbæk","Larsen, Lars Bo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-114345"],"event":{"end":"2016-07-31","place":"Florida, us","start":"2016-07-27","title":"AHFE 2016 International Conference on The Human Side of Service Engineering","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the impact of reviews and average rating on hotel booking intention a qualitative study","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.springer.com/us/book/9783319419466","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-114345","identifier":[{"id":"84986275756","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-dd15e631-7aa0-4639-bcbf-a0c1684acf5a"],"keyword":["Hotel-booking · Decision-making · Review · Rating · User-generated information · eWOM · Qualitative research"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5C97E812312DDC803AA05AED70C148B3"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Line Thomassen","key":"buuspau","last":"Buus","locid":"fd782d71-0dbc-40e2-91a6-0c8c5fb347fc","name":"Buus, Line Thomassen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Thodberg","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"adc3b813-9e0e-4d97-b35b-4d1199ed57c4","name":"Jensen, Charlotte Thodberg","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anne Mette Karnøe","key":"jessenpau","last":"Jessen","locid":"950393a4-7515-4c14-84dc-400ec9cb7ea7","name":"Jessen, Anne Mette Karnøe","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lotte Ishoy","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"d8a45a67-e7ea-41b8-bb01-69d97b98639c","name":"Jørgensen, Lotte Ishoy","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jeanette Kølbæk","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","locid":"a0d11ecf-766c-499d-b4d2-e09cd34ad856","name":"Laursen, Jeanette Kølbæk","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"