{"abstract":"In a commercial diagnostic setting streamlining and optimization is an important factor when the goal is to provide high quality diagnostic results while remaining competitive. In the PCR diagnostics unit at DTU National Veterinary Institute part of this optimization programme is to replace conventional PCR assays with real-time PCR assays to obtain a uniform assay palette. The present work describes the development of a novel real-time RT-qPCR assay for the dual detection of canine and phocine distemper virus. The assay is relevant for the future detection of outbreaks of canine distemper virus in e.g. in farmed mink and wildlife and phocine distemper in seals. A set of primers and dual labelled probe was designed based on an alignment of distemper sequences in GenBank from various species and in-house sequences from recent outbreaks in Danish farmed mink. The assay amplifies a segment of 151 bp in the Phosphoprotein (P) gene of the distemper virus genome. The dynamic range and PCR efficiency (E) was experimentally determined using 10-fold dilutions of a specially designed distemper DNA-oligo in addition to extracted RNA from clinical samples. E of the real-time assay was shown to range between 0.95 and 1.05 when using both clinical samples and the distemper DNA-oligo. Comparing the real-time RT-PCR assay to a currently used conventional assay showed that the real-time assay detects a 102 –fold further dilution of a clinical sample. Tests of distemper positive clinical samples from a wide range of different species performed in parallel with the conventional PCR assay revealed that whereas both assays detect canine and phocine distemper virus, only the conventional assay could detect the dolphin distemper variant. Furthermore it was shown that the Taqman assay does not amplify influenza, a common differential diagnosis in mink and seals. Further testing is needed to determine the effects of PCR inhibitors in clinical samples. In addition, an elaborate panel of potential differential diagnostic agents must be tested in order to determine the assay specificity.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Linette Buxbom","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Larsen, Helene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-370637"],"event":{"end":"2016-10-21","place":"London, gb","start":"2016-10-20","title":"4<sup>th </sup>qPCR &amp; Digital PCR Congress","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"development of a novel real time qpcr assay for the dual detection of canine and phocine distemper virus","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/127426546/Poster_abstract.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-370637","ids":["dtu-dcea422f-52b7-4060-ae41-e60b90ce57fd"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-75C601A0F8D319ECFC3D60EC8A9C2BE8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/127426546/Poster_abstract.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Linette Buxbom","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"0c692353-e3da-4c8c-ad04-5489c4491d4a","name":"Nielsen, Linette Buxbom","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Kristiane","key":"hjulsagerpau","last":"Hjulsager","locid":"6c1511ef-8211-4653-8c81-cd55b7f63f64","name":"Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","orcid":"0000-0001-7557-8876","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Helene","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"42a4eb79-1cad-4fcc-876c-8d01f35c8389","name":"Larsen, Helene","orcid":"0000-0001-5065-4967","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-dcea422f-52b7-4060-ae41-e60b90ce57fd"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Development of a novel real-time qPCR assay for the dual detection of canine and phocine distemper virus","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-370637","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"I dette veterinære speciale blev det vist, at polte, der var vaccineret mod PRRS-virus (PRRSV), ikke udskilte virus ved første løbning. Studiet fandt en tendens til en sammenhæng mellem brug af karantæne og det, at poltene var beskyttet af antistoffer mod PRRSV. Studiet inkluderede 69 besætninger positive for PRRSV. Der blev taget 5 blodprøver fra løbeklare polte i hver besætning, og et spørgeskema vedrørende polterekrutteringsstrategi, vaccinationsstrategi m.m. blev udfyldt. Blodprøverne blev analyseret for PRRSV ved RT-qPCR, ELISA og IPT. Studiet viste, at poltene fra de deltagende besætninger ikke havde PRRSV i blodet (var viræmiske) ved første løbning, og at der var en lille del, som ikke havde dannet antistoffer mod PRRSV trods vaccination. Sidstnævnte kunne tyde på et svigt i vaccinationsproceduren i besætningerne. Desuden var det meget få besætninger, der reelt havde en optimal karantæne. En optimal karantæne blev defineret som en stald, der ikke delte luftrum med øvrige staldafsnit, havde separat indgang og kørte alt ind/alt ud. På trods af at poltene ikke var viræmiske ved løbning, fører studiet ikke til ændringer i anbefalingerne vedrørende introduktion af polte i PRRS-positive besætninger. Anbefalingerne er derfor stadig at immunisere poltene og så sætte dem i karantæne i minimum 8 uger og allerhelst 12.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Hoelstad, Bonnie Edahl","Sonne Kristensen, Charlotte","Qvist Pawlowski, Mia","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Kvisgaard, Lise Kirstine","Lauritsen, Klara Tølbøl","Larsen, Lars Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-379460"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"introduktion af polte i prrsv besætninger notat nr 000000001609","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/127568440/Notat_1609.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-379460","ids":["dtu-fa461674-58f8-4268-a200-cb75ecb9eb69"],"lang":"English","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1266DE3D0EBC2129DDC59F9CC09D44EA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://vsp.lf.dk/Publikationer/Kilder/Notater/2016/1609.aspx","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/127568440/Notat_1609.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bonnie Edahl","key":"hoelstadpau","last":"Hoelstad","locid":"92382afb-0149-4317-9ed9-2d2e18277c21","name":"Hoelstad, Bonnie Edahl","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"sonnekristensenpau","last":"Sonne Kristensen","name":"Sonne Kristensen, Charlotte","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Mia","key":"qvistpawlowskipau","last":"Qvist Pawlowski","name":"Qvist Pawlowski, Mia","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Kristiane","key":"hjulsagerpau","last":"Hjulsager","locid":"6c1511ef-8211-4653-8c81-cd55b7f63f64","name":"Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","orcid":"0000-0001-7557-8876","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lise Kirstine","key":"kvisgaardpau","last":"Kvisgaard","locid":"58ce239f-6c30-44e0-ab54-f017a1821425","name":"Kvisgaard, Lise Kirstine","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Klara Tølbøl","key":"lauritsenpau","last":"Lauritsen","locid":"13169d33-175c-4684-abc2-3331fb5246c2","name":"Lauritsen, Klara Tølbøl","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"09c2a33d-b353-44de-a850-f3c7dec879cb","name":"Larsen, Lars Erik","orcid":"0000-0003-0730-5555","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"4","publisher":"Videncenter for Svineproduktion","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","sdg":["3. Good Health and Well-being","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-fa461674-58f8-4268-a200-cb75ecb9eb69"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Introduktion af polte i PRRSV-besætninger : Notat nr. 1609","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-379460","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"The chemokine CXCL12/stromal cell-derived factor-1 is important for leukocyte migration to lymphoid organs and inflamed tissues and stimulates tumor development. In vitro, CXCL12 activity through CXCR4 is abolished by proteolytic processing. However, limited information is available on in vivo effects of posttranslationally modified CXCL12. Natural CXCL12 was purified from the coculture supernatant of stromal cells stimulated with leukocytes and inflammatory agents. In this conditioned medium, CXCL12 with a nitration on Tyr7, designated [3-NT7]CXCL12, was discovered via Edman degradation. CXCL12 and [3-NT7]CXCL12 were chemically synthesized to evaluate the biological effects of this modification. [3-NT7]CXCL12 recruited β-arrestin 2 and phosphorylated the Akt kinase similar to CXCL12 in receptor-transfected cells. Also the affinity of CXCL12 and [3-NT7]CXCL12 for glycosaminoglycans, the G protein-coupled chemokine receptor CXCR4 and the atypical chemokine receptor ACKR3 were comparable. However, [3-NT7]CXCL12 showed a reduced ability to enhance intracellular calcium concentrations, to generate inositol triphosphate, to phosphorylate ERK1/2 and to induce monocyte and lymphocyte chemotaxis in vitro. Moreover, nitrated CXCL12 failed to induce in vivo extravasation of lymphocytes to the joint. In summary, nitration on Tyr7 under inflammatory conditions is a novel natural posttranslational regulatory mechanism of CXCL12 which may downregulate the CXCR4-mediated inflammatory and tumor-promoting activities of CXCL12.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Janssens, Rik","Mortier, Anneleen","Boff, Daiane","Vanheule, Vincent","Gouwy, Mieke","Franck, Charlotte","Larsen, Olav","Rosenkilde, Mette M.","Damme, Jo Van","Amaral, Flávio A.","Teixeira, Mauro M.","Struyf, Sofie","Proost, Paul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-422229"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, South"],"country":["Brazil"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Universidade Federal de Minas Gerais"],"keyword":["Chemokine","Chemotaxis","Extravasation","Lymphocyte migration","Posttranslational modification"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"natural nitration of cxcl000000000012 reduces its signaling capacity and chemotactic activity in vitro and abrogates intra articular lymphocyte recruitment in vivo","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/168855836/11516_174110_2_PB_1_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-422229","identifier":[{"id":"27566567","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84991824703","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC5308738","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-3047ff13-ecaa-4117-8a82-fd5dbc22809c"],"keyword":["Chemokine","Chemotaxis","Extravasation","Lymphocyte migration","Posttranslational modification"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-069F17F693062AEA5D74AF7F9D7E29B4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/168855836/11516_174110_2_PB_1_.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"br","key":"universidade federal de minas gerais","loc":["Brazil","America, South"],"name":"Universidade Federal de Minas Gerais","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Neuroscience, Molpharm Lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Rik","key":"janssenspau","last":"Janssens","name":"Janssens, Rik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anneleen","key":"mortierpau","last":"Mortier","name":"Mortier, Anneleen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Daiane","key":"boffpau","last":"Boff","name":"Boff, Daiane","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Vincent","key":"vanheulepau","last":"Vanheule","name":"Vanheule, Vincent","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Mieke","key":"gouwypau","last":"Gouwy","name":"Gouwy, Mieke","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Charlotte","key":"franckpau","last":"Franck","name":"Franck, Charlotte","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Olav","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"321e5538-1221-49f8-a37b-68e2f9410c83","name":"Larsen, Olav","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Mette M.","key":"rosenkildepau","last":"Rosenkilde","locid":"d902feb8-1594-4fa8-bcb1-9f646dc30dd3","name":"Rosenkilde, Mette M.","orcid":"0000-0001-9600-3254","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jo Van","key":"dammepau","last":"Damme","name":"Damme, Jo Van","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Flávio A.","key":"amaralpau","last":"Amaral","name":"Amaral, Flávio A.","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mauro M.","key":"teixeirapau","last":"Teixeira","name":"Teixeira, Mauro M.","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sofie","key":"struyfpau","last":"Struyf","name":"Struyf, Sofie","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Paul","key":"proostpau","last":"Proost","name":"Proost, Paul","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27566567"],"pub":{"doi":"10.18632/oncotarget.11516","issn":["19492553"],"issue":"38","journal":"OncoTarget","pages":"62439-62459","status":"p","title":"OncoTarget","volume":"7"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84991824703"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-3047ff13-ecaa-4117-8a82-fd5dbc22809c"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Natural nitration of CXCL12 reduces its signaling capacity and chemotactic activity in vitro and abrogates intra-articular lymphocyte recruitment in vivo","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-422229","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Diskursen om aktiv aldring, den tilknyttede viden og tænkning, samt de deraf ændrede praksisformer, kan ses som et forsøg på at lette demografiske udfordringer i form af en aldrende befolkning. Gennem kritisk diskursanalyse af udvalgte dokumenter vises en påfaldende blindhed overfor forhold, der er af væsentlig betydning for vores sundhed og levealder, herunder for hvordan og hvornår vi ældes, fx betydningerne af uddannelse, social position, netværk/relationer og køn. Når den attråværdige alderdom entydigt fremstilles som den ”aktive” usynliggøres, at ældres muligheder for at leve op til dens normative idealer er ulige distribueret. Sider af alderdommen fraspaltes, og det bliver vanskeligt at forstå de liv, der ikke lever op til normen som meningsfulde.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Liveng, Anne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-560750"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"aktiv aldring en sundhedsskabende eller usynliggørende diskurs","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-560750","ids":["ruc-4775df3c-bef2-4fe2-ba76-ebe1abea9418"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-359518329E8F9CB4B0F5EB31B3EA1601"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Anne","key":"livengpau","last":"Liveng","locid":"e4478baa-0741-4db7-904c-9994ba4a7fd9","name":"Liveng, Anne","orcid":"0000-0001-5920-3492","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sine","key":"lehnpedh","last":"Lehn","name":"Lehn, Sine","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Anne","key":"livengpedh","last":"Liveng","name":"Liveng, Anne","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Betina","key":"dybbroepedh","last":"Dybbroe","name":"Dybbroe, Betina","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mari","key":"holenpedh","last":"Holen","name":"Holen, Mari","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Nicole","key":"thualagantpedh","last":"Thualagant","name":"Thualagant, Nicole","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Iben Charlotte","key":"aamannpedh","last":"Aamann","name":"Aamann, Iben Charlotte","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Birgitta Nordenhof","key":"larsenpedh","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Birgitta Nordenhof","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"issue":"1","pages":"147-174","place":"Frederiksberg","publisher":"Frydenlund Academic","series":"Sundhed, Samfund og Kultur","status":"p","subtitle":"Nye humanistiske og samfundsvidenskabelige perspektiver","title":"Ulighed i sundhed"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-4775df3c-bef2-4fe2-ba76-ebe1abea9418"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Aktiv aldring : en sundhedsskabende eller usynliggørende diskurs?","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-560750","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Kapitlet har til formål at bidrage til en overordnet forståelse af, hvordan den velfærdsprofessionelle kan arbejde med og udvikle kompetence til at indgå i samskabelse forstået som co-production, hvor særligt samarbejdet mellem borger og den velfærdsprofessionelle er i fokus. Det er her eksemplificeret ved en case om et samskabelsesforløb i et mindre lokalsamfund med deltaglese af lokale aktører, forældre og personale i en privat daginstitution. Processerne er generelt relevante for velfærdsprofessionelle som indgår i samskabelse og har fokus på udvikling af den velfærdsprofessionelles kompetencer i samskabelse og delkompetencer i innovation og didaktik.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Løvstad, Charlotte Vange","Nørgaard, Astrid Kidde Larsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-660222"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Daginstitutioner","Deltagelse","Entreprenørskabsundervisning","Forældresamarbejde","Innovation og entreprenørskab","Innovativ undervisning","Lokalsamfund","Samskabelse"],"level":"edu","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"den velfærdsprofessionelles samskabelseskompetence","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-660222","ids":["via-bbe48838-7276-4434-8084-a76990f40070"],"keyword":["daginstitutioner","deltagelse","entreprenørskabsundervisning","forældresamarbejde","innovation og entreprenørskab","innovativ undervisning","innovative processer","lokalsamfund","samskabelse","velfærdsprofessionelles samskabelseskompetence"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Educational","noi":["Local-1-1-627BE55F18723B0E4E976B8C92DC8DEE"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forsk.center Pædagogik og dannelse","VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskningsområde for pædagogik og dannelse, Program for børns trivsel","VIA, Uddannelser, Sundhedsuddannelserne"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte Vange","key":"løvstadpau","last":"Løvstad","locid":"9f3cb2da-29ee-41cc-b40c-e0b923987633","name":"Løvstad, Charlotte Vange","orcid":"0000-0001-6428-4258","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Astrid Kidde","key":"nørgaardpau","last":"Nørgaard","locid":"55bd85c3-5b83-438e-91db-1246474d0cc7","name":"Nørgaard, Astrid Kidde Larsen","name_org":"Nørgaard, Astrid Kidde","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Esben","key":"hulgårdpedh","last":"Hulgård","name":"Hulgård, Esben","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Maja","key":"juulolsenpedh","last":"Juul-Olsen","name":"Juul-Olsen, Maja","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Elof","key":"nellemannnielsenpedh","last":"Nellemann Nielsen","name":"Nellemann Nielsen, Elof","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788741264301"],"pages":"143-178","publisher":"Hans Reitzels Forlag","status":"p","subtitle":"en casebaseret grundbog til professionsuddannelserne","title":"Samskabelse og socialt entreprenørskab"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["via-bbe48838-7276-4434-8084-a76990f40070"],"src":["VIA University College"],"title":"Den velfærdsprofessionelles samskabelseskompetence","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-660222","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Biosynthesis of the black perithecial pigment in the filamentous fungus Fusarium graminearum is dependent on the polyketide synthase PGL1 (oPKS3). A seven-membered PGL1 gene cluster was identified by over-expression of the cluster specific transcription factor pglR. Targeted gene replacement showed that PGL1, pglJ, pglM and pglV were essential for the production of the perithecial pigment. Over-expression of PGL1 resulted in the production of 6-O-demethyl-5-deoxybostrycoidin (1), 5-deoxybostrycoidin (2), and three novel compounds 5-deoxybostrycoidin anthrone (3), 6-O-demethyl-5-deoxybostrycoidin anthrone (4) and purpurfusarin (5). The novel dimeric bostrycoidin purpurfusarin (5) was found to inhibit the growth of Candida albicans with an IC50 of 8.0 +/-1.9 mu M. The results show that Fusarium species with black perithecia have a previously undescribed form of 5-deoxybostrycoidin based melanin in their fruiting bodies.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Frandsen, Rasmus J N","Rasmussen, Silas A","Knudsen, Peter B","Uhlig, Silvio","Petersen, Dirk","Lysøe, Erik","Gotfredsen, Charlotte H","Giese, Henriette","Larsen, Thomas O"],"cuid":["S02-099.73-007533"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Norwegian Institute of Bioeconomy Research","Norwegian Veterinary Institute","University of Oslo"],"keyword":["Fungal biology","Journal Article","Metabolomics","Molecular evolution"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Section for Chemistry and Toxicology, Norwegian Veterinary Institute, Oslo, Norway."],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"black perithecial pigmentation in i fusarium i species is due to the accumulation of 000000000005 deoxybostrycoidin based melanin","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/srep26206","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-099.73-007533","identifier":[{"id":"27193384","type":"pmid"},{"id":"000376063900001","type":"wos"},{"id":"PMC4872168","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84970021277","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-9b56a040-dd3c-4fc6-8bc1-bfeec07676e6","dtu-20bd3323-b246-4e4f-8a5d-f5b24836bf4d"],"keyword":["Fungal biology","Journal Article","Metabolomics","Molecular evolution"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-98A220BEAAAFC54933C2E3CA56FF2CD9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/srep26206","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4872168/pdf/srep26206.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/125119244/Black_perithecial_pigmentation_in_Fusarium_species_is_due_to_the_accumulation_of_5_deoxybostrycoidin_based_melanin.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology, Eucaryotic Molecular Cell Biology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nor