{"abstract":"In this chapter, we emphasise what we have outlined as interesting areas of relational leadership and present some ideas on how to facilitate a broader understanding of relational leadership practice. This involves the interpretations that create connections between practice and ontology. We elaborate on how leadership in everyday situations can be understood from a relational perspective. The chapter will focus on outlining and inspiring the reader to co-operate with other people to develop further relational understandings of leading.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Madsen, Charlotte Øland","Rasmussen, Jørgen Gulddahl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-094891"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Relational leadership"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"relational leadership ontology and practice","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-094891","identifier":[{"id":"84960355065","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-9aa51304-fec3-47e6-b04a-5894adf6d1a1"],"keyword":["Relational Leadership"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-694625EB7BDF2096F8FC5D47BF517AC8"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy, Centre for Learning in Organisations","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Business and Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"p