{"abstract":"In this paper we discuss methodological strategies for collecting multimodal data using digital resources. The aim is to show how digital resources can provide ethnographic insights into mediated actions (Scollon, 2002) that can otherwise be difficult to observe or engage in, due to, for instance, restrictions or privately mediated settings. Having used mediated discourse analysis (Scollon 2002, Scollon & Scollon, 2004) as a framework in two different research projects, we show how the framework, in correlation with digital resources for data gathering, provides new understandings of 1) the daily practice of health care professionals (Author 1, 2014) and 2) young people’s identity construction on social media platforms (Author 2, 2010, 2015, in press). The paper’s contribution is a methodological discussion on digital data collection using methods such as online interviewing (via e-mail or chat) and online questionnaire data in order to capture mediated actions and discourses in practice.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Kjær, Malene","Larsen, Malene Charlotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-072220"],"event":{"end":"2015-11-20","place":"Valencia, es","start":"2015-11-19","title":"International conference: Approaches to digital discourse analysis","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"digital methods for mediated discourse analysis","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://adda.blogs.uv.es/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-072220","ids":["aau-4c79ed37-61f3-4c98-bd1f-7781494770b5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-54164F4A0ED6EB838F5021D1480C549D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Mattering: Centre for Discourse & Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Malene","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","locid":"07788405-b51b-4859-bfa4-acfa12a002e5","name":"Kjær, Malene","orcid":"0000-0003-0568-1979","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Malene Charlotte","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"cc0033d3-6794-4e0c-b451-939e05f9a1ee","name":"Larsen, Malene Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-4821-5855","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"place":"Valencia","status":"p","subtitle":"1st international conference: Approaches to digital discourse analysis","title":"ADDA 1"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-4c79ed37-61f3-4c98-bd1f-7781494770b5"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Digital methods for mediated discourse analysis","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-072220","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
