{"abstract":"Since April 2014, an outbreak of influenza in harbor seals has been ongoing in northern Europe. In Denmark during June-August, 152 harbor seals on the island of Anholt were found dead from severe pneumonia. We detected influenza A(H10N7) virus in 2 of 4 seals examined.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Krog, Jesper S","Hansen, Mette S","Holm, Elisabeth","Hjulsager, Charlotte K","Chriél, Mariann","Pedersen, Karl","Andresen, Lars O","Abildstrøm, Morten","Jensen, Trine Hammer","Larsen, Lars E"],"cuid":["S02-096.88-000114"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Animals","Denmark","Genes Viral","Orthomyxoviridae Infections","Phoca","Phylogeny"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Anholt Gartneri & Naturpleje"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"influenza a h000000000010n000000000007 virus in dead harbor seals denmark","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3201/eid2104.141484","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-096.88-000114","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000351652100021","type":"wos"},{"id":"PMC4378493","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"25811098","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84924933906","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-021ace3c-4a1a-4e74-92da-c0c1d7edaa2e","dtu-ccdd4b96-6271-452e-9e32-9b09fa40d848"],"keyword":["Animals","Denmark","Genes, Viral","Influenza A Virus, H10N7 Subtype","Orthomyxoviridae Infections","Phoca","Phylogeny"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-918E91BDB0714709B86AABF667319DFB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/110761657/Influenza_A_H10N7_virus_in_dead_harbor_se