Allan Grutt","orcid":"0000-0002-3908-5561","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ansa","key":"lønstruppedh","last":"Lønstrup","name":"Lønstrup, Ansa","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Charlotte","key":"rørdamlarsenpedh","last":"Rørdam Larsen","name":"Rørdam Larsen, Charlotte","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Nina","key":"grampedh","last":"Gram","name":"Gram, Nina","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Anders","key":"bondepedh","last":"Bonde","name":"Bonde, Anders","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788771292688"],"place":"Århus","publisher":"Klim","status":"p","subtitle":"Om lyd i kontekst","title":"Blik for lyd"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-8f8c297f-3647-46ca-a25a-4513a7829469"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Udtryksforstærkning i audiovisuelle kortformater : En kvantitativ undersøgelse af samspillet mellem musik og levende billeder","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-091761","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Brugen af sociale medier er en integreret del af langt de fleste danske unges hverdagsliv. De 16-24-årige er den del af befolkningen, som er kraftigst repræsenteret på sociale medier som Facebook, Instagram, Snapchat og Twitter. I denne aldersgruppe er stort set alle tilknyttet en eller flere sociale netværkstjenester. Men hvilken værdi er det, de sociale medier har? Hvordan indgår de i ungdomslivets sociale relationer? Hvad karakteriserer et venskab online? Og hvad med de unge, som ikke har venner eller føler sig ensomme? Med dette indlæg ønsker vi at synliggøre, hvorledes sociale medier indgår i ungdomslivet. Både for unge, der trives godt, og dem, der har det svært. Indlægget er baseret på forsknings- såvel som praksisbaseret viden om danske unges brug af sociale medier. Vi starter med en afklaring af selve betegnelsen sociale medier. Herefter fokuserer vi på, hvordan danske unge bruger sociale medier i hverdagen – både som tidsfordriv og som en måde at bekræfte og vedligeholde venskaber på. Vi diskuterer dernæst venskabsbegrebet online og synliggør, hvorledes net-venner kan være meget værdifulde og fungere som særligt fortrolige for visse unge. Vi diskuterer dét at føle sig ensom eller være uden for fællesskabet på sociale medier og slutter af med en række gode råd til fagfolk, der gerne vil hjælpe unge ud af ensomhed.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Malene Charlotte","Lange, Jon Kristian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-121503"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sociale medier i ungdomslivet venskaber og ensomhed online","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.ventilen.dk/materialer/product/ensom-men-ikke-alene/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-121503","ids":["aau-f5db7072-be3e-4537-a5b2-f4174e4e27c8"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BBC3C29886B952C070608BC708E6D64E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Mattering: Centre for Discourse & Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Malene Charlotte","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"cc0033d3-6794-4e0c-b451-939e05f9a1ee","name":"Larsen, Malene Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-4821-5855","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jon Kristian","key":"langepau","last":"Lange","name":"Lange, Jon Kristian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Karen Lerstrup","key":"pedersenpedh","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Karen Lerstrup","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"edition":"1.","isbn":["9788799112197"],"pages":"126-145","place":"København K.","publisher":"Ventilen","status":"p","subtitle":"En antologi om unge og ensomhed","title":"Ensom, men ikke alene","volume":"1."},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-f5db7072-be3e-4537-a5b2-f4174e4e27c8"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Sociale medier i ungdomslivet : Venskaber og ensomhed online","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-121503","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Bogen introducerer som den første bog på dansk til et voksende internationalt fag- og forskningsfelt, Sound Studies, som stadig er i boblendeudvikling og som er markant interdisciplinært og henvender sig til så forskellige områder som medie-, sprog-, informations- og kommunikationsfag, kunst- og kulturfag, geografi- og arkitekturfag samt handels- og organisationsfag. Det sker gennem otte forskellige bidrag, som med lyttende og analytisk afsært undersøger forskellige lydfænomener i kontekst: fra lyd i film, musikvideo, reklamer, lydkunst og lydbøger til lyd og urbanitet - lyd og lokalitet.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Lønstrup, Ansa","Larsen, Charlotte Rørdam","Gram, Nina","Bonde, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-232624"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"blik for lyd om lyd i kontekst","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-232624","ids":["au-b50e5f05-c981-4e46-9a34-549be8d34f41"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B502EAA0729FB0568A2507AC00157BDE"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Aesthetics and Culture"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ansa","key":"lønstrupped","last":"Lønstrup","locid":"ff2eefbd-6c98-427d-a8b8-893437032dbc","name":"Lønstrup, Ansa","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Rørdam","key":"larsenped","last":"Larsen","locid":"4e604018-2471-4a68-a18b-0ae187425b3d","name":"Larsen, Charlotte Rørdam","orcid":"0000-0002-5465-0338","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nina","key":"gramped","last":"Gram","locid":"7c4fe137-1647-4969-8c31-0f81efd60b93","name":"Gram, Nina","rank":3,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"bondeped","last":"Bonde","name":"Bonde, Anders","rank":4,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"edition":"1. udgave","isbn":["978 87 7129 268 8"],"pages":"197","place":"Arhus: Klim","publisher":"Klim","status":"p","volume":"1"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-b50e5f05-c981-4e46-9a34-549be8d34f41"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Blik for Lyd : Om lyd i kontekst","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-232624","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"At the end of August 2014 an aerial seal counting was done by Aarhus University (Galatius, A) and increased mortality was observed on a small island Ejerslev Røn (56° 56’N 0, 8° 57’Ø) and a sand bank Blinderøn about 4 km south-east of Ejserslev Røn. Both islands/sandbanks are protected nature reserves. The islands were inspected the following day by boat/walking. In total, 56 dead seals were found on Ejerslev Røn and Blinderøn. Four were shot due to severe respiratory symptoms and these four seals did not escape into the water when approached. All 60 seals except one with fishing net around the neck were dead within few days. One of the seals had a tag showing it had been through rehabilitation in the Netherlands (Zeehondencreche Pieterburen) in 2010, where it was treated for a lungworm infection (information from Lenie’t Hart about the tagged seal). This indicates the long distances seals are travelling and that lungworm infections can be successfully treated. A field necropsy was done on the four shot seals and all suffered from pneumonia. Three of the seals had empty stomachs and intestines but all 4 seals were in good nutritional condition with blubber thickness ranging from 1.2 cm to 2.0 cm suggesting a short duration of the pneumonia. Influenza virus was found in the lungs, subtyping is pending. At inspection, 12 days later only 1 recently dead seal was found indicating the mortality had peaked within a short time and only within a small geographic area. °","author_count":8,"contributors":["Jensen, Trine Hammer","Krog, Jesper Schak","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Larsen, Lars Erik","Chriél, Mariann","Holm, Elisabeth","Pedersen, Karl","Hansen, Mette Sif"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-343314"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"locally increased mortality of harbour seals phoca vitulina in the danish limfjord","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-343314","ids":["dtu-81bd6a04-fd82-4be9-91df-96b0f13cd644"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-15F748A15ADEB00A606075011B5C4208"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine Hammer","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"65bdc4e2-15ab-4421-ae6c-a810ff7952ee","name":"Jensen, Trine Hammer","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Schak","key":"krogpau","last":"Krog","locid":"1e238a71-3075-4303-91fe-3cedb620123d","name":"Krog, Jesper Schak","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Kristiane","key":"hjulsagerpau","last":"Hjulsager","locid":"6c1511ef-8211-4653-8c81-cd55b7f63f64","name":"Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","orcid":"0000-0001-7557-8876","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"09c2a33d-b353-44de-a850-f3c7dec879cb","name":"Larsen, Lars Erik","orcid":"0000-0003-0730-5555","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mariann","key":"chriélpau","last":"Chriél","locid":"1a5d6261-6bd2-4940-baab-5d5fcc3c0f7c","name":"Chriél, Mariann","orcid":"0000-0001-5306-4495","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Elisabeth","key":"holmpau","last":"Holm","locid":"07c945b3-4fe0-496a-9734-095800683729","name":"Holm, Elisabeth","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Karl","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"d1138736-2a78-423a-9950-0ce651434ec7","name":"Pedersen, Karl","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mette Sif","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"5d04b165-7fc1-46cf-88f7-35be695b954c","name":"Hansen, Mette Sif","orcid":"0000-0002-8132-8475","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issue":"October","journal":"Wildlife Disease Association Newsletter","publisher":"Wildlife Disease Association","status":"p","title":"Wildlife Disease Association Newsletter"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-81bd6a04-fd82-4be9-91df-96b0f13cd644"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Locally increased mortality of harbour seals (Phoca vitulina) in the Danish Limfjord","type":"Journal Comment","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-343314","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Der er i 2013 gennemført en systematisk passiv overvågning af cirkulerende influenzavirus subtyper i danske svin. Det overordnede formål med overvågningen var at identificere hvilke influenzavirus subtyper og stammer, der cirkulerer blandt danske svin, og at kortlægge sygdomsårsager i svinepopulationen med henblik på at sikre det strategiske mål: at mindske antibiotikaforbruget i danske svinebesætninger.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Krog, Jesper Schak","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Larsen, Lars Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-347813"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"overvågning af influenza a virus i svin i 000000002013 slutrapport 000000002013 opsummering og konklusion","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-347813","ids":["dtu-90f8f2f8-b000-414d-8e77-660245c0a4a6"],"lang":"English","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-807F59EA12ACE67381502C48278A744A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Schak","key":"krogpau","last":"Krog","locid":"1e238a71-3075-4303-91fe-3cedb620123d","name":"Krog, Jesper Schak","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Kristiane","key":"hjulsagerpau","last":"Hjulsager","locid":"6c1511ef-8211-4653-8c81-cd55b7f63f64","name":"Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","orcid":"0000-0001-7557-8876","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"09c2a33d-b353-44de-a850-f3c7dec879cb","name":"Larsen, Lars Erik","orcid":"0000-0003-0730-5555","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"3","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-90f8f2f8-b000-414d-8e77-660245c0a4a6"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Overvågning af influenza A virus i svin i 2013. Slutrapport 2013 : Opsummering og konklusion","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-347813","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Bivalve shellfish are at constant risk of being exposed to pathogens as a consequence of contamination of the shellfish beds with human or animal waste originating from sewage treatment plants or slurry fertilized fields. Consumption of contaminated oysters and mussels are frequently reported as causes of disease outbreaks caused by norovirus or hepatitis A virus. Other zoonotic pathogens such as hepatitis E virus (HEV), rotavirus (RV) and Salmonella from livestock may also be transmitted to shellfish via this route. In this study, 29 pooled samples from commercial Danish blue mussels were tested for porcine pathogens and indicator bacteria Escherichia coli (E. coli). All samples tested negative for HEV, RV and Salmonella, whereas E. coli and the highly stable porcine circovirus type 2 (PCV2) were detected in eight and 12 samples, respectively. This is the first study to report the detection of PCV2 in commercial mussels. Based on the detection of PCV2 in clean areas with low prevalence of the normally applied fecal indicator E. coli, testing for PCV2 may be a more sensitive and robust specific porcine waste indicator in shellfish harvesting areas.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Krog, Jesper Schak","Larsen, Lars Erik","Schultz, Anna Charlotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-377822"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Hepatitis E virus","Mussels","Rotavirus"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"enteric porcine viruses in farmed shellfish in denmark","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/97946256/Jesper_Schak_Krog_Lars_Erik_Larsen_Anna_Charlotte_Schultz_Enteric_porcine_viruses_in_farmed_shellfish_in_Denmark.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-377822","identifier":[{"id":"84904087750","type":"scopus"},{"id":"25016209","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-f4c553b2-8f39-4533-a5f2-cc726bfb58c7"],"keyword":["Hepatitis E virus","Mussels","Porcine cirovirus","Rotavirus"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-93E9AFBDA340663D190CE8E2D81C6664"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/97946256/Jesper_Schak_Krog_Lars_Erik_Larsen_Anna_Charlotte_Schultz_Enteric_porcine_viruses_in_farmed_shellfish_in_Denmark.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijfoodmicro.2014.06.012","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jesper Schak","key":"krogpau","last":"Krog","locid":"1e238a71-3075-4303-91fe-3cedb620123d","name":"Krog, Jesper Schak","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"09c2a33d-b353-44de-a850-f3c7dec879cb","name":"Larsen, Lars Erik","orcid":"0000-0003-0730-5555","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anna Charlotte","key":"schultzpau","last":"Schultz","locid":"3a3d5130-acf6-4846-93e3-f3b891d83e60","name":"Schultz, Anna Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0003-1484-9120","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25016209"],"pub":{"do