{"abstract":"Porcine Reproductive and Respiratory Syndrome (PRRS) viruses are divided into two major genotypes (Type 1 and Type 2) based on their genetic diversity. Type 1 PRRSV is further divided into at least 3 subtypes, but until now only subtype 1 has been detected in Western Europe and North America. Both genotypes are circulating in Denmark and since gilt vaccinations are widely used it is essential to monitor the diversity of circulating PRRS viruses. Prior to the present study, however, the diversity of circulating viruses in Denmark was virtually unknown. The main objective was to assess the diversity of circulating PRRS viruses in Danish pigs and to investigate the genetic drift of the virus in a closed population with very limited introductions of new animals. The study included phylogenetic analysis of full genome sequences of eight Type 1 and nine Type 2 PRRS viruses, including the very first Danish isolated Type 1 virus and the very first Danish Type 2 PRRS virus isolated from a non-vaccinated pig herd. Furthermore, by sequencing ORF5 and ORF7 of 43 Type 1 and 57 Type 2 viruses isolated between 2003 and 2013, the level of genetic diversity was assessed. The results showed a very high genetic diversity among the Danish viruses throughout the genome within the same genotype. A global phylogenetic analysis showed that the Danish Type 1 PRRSV formed two major clusters, one vaccine (Porcilis)-like clade exclusively containing viruses isolated after the Porcilis vaccine was introduced and another distinct clade consisting mainly of viruses isolated in Denmark. Phylogenetic analysis in a global Type 2 PRRSV framework classified all Danish Type 2 viruses to a single cluster (sub-lineage 5.1) which comprised viruses closely related to the Type 2 prototype isolate VR2332. Both Type 1 and Type 2 harbored deletions in the region encoding nsp2 and some significant amino acid changes were also seen in antigenic sites. Acknowledgement: The study was supported by EU Grant n° 245141 (New tools and approaches to control Porcine Reproductive and Respiratory Syndrome in the EU and Asia (PoRRSCon) coordinated by Prof. H. Nauwynck.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Kvisgaard, Lise Kirstine","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Larsen, Lars Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-334267"],"event":{"end":"2014-06-06","place":"Salamanca, es","start":"2014-06-01","title":"13th International Nidovirus Symposium","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genetic and antigenic drift of porcine reproductive and respiratory syndrome virus prrsv in a closed population evaluated by full genome sequencing","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/103527028/PRRSV_abstract_Lise_Kirstine_Kvisgaard_Nidovirus_2014.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-334267","ids":["dtu-63af345d-b465-47d2-9684-ccb9f372a163"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-15218619C2E532B7F0CA523F1509935D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/103527028/PRRSV_abstract_Lise_Kirstine_Kvisgaard_Nidovirus_2014.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute, Section for Virology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lise Kirstine","key":"kvisgaardpau","last":"Kvisgaard","locid":"58ce239f-6c30-44e0-ab54-f017a1821425","name":"Kvisgaard, Lise Kirstine","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Kristiane","key":"hjulsagerpau","last":"Hjulsager","locid":"6c1511ef-8211-4653-8c81-cd55b7f63f64","name":"Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","orcid":"0000-0001-7557-8876","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"09c2a33d-b353-44de-a850-f3c7dec879cb","name":"Larsen, Lars Erik","orcid":"0000-0003-0730-5555","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","sdg":["3. Good Health and Well-being","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-63af345d-b465-47d2-9684-ccb9f372a163"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Genetic and antigenic drift of Porcine Reproductive and Respiratory Syndrome Virus (PRRSV) in a closed population evaluated by full genome sequencing","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-334267","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Pt–Ru catalysts of various compositions, between 0 and 100at.% of Ru, were deposited onto N-doped multi-walled carbon nanotubes (N-CNTs) by atomic layer deposition (ALD) at 250°C. The Pt and Ru precursors were trimethyl(methylcyclopentadienyl)platinum (MeCpPtMe3) and bis(ethylcyclopentadienyl)ruthenium (Ru(EtCp)2), respectively. O2 was used as the reactant in both processes. The composition of the catalysts was easily tuned by varying the Pt-to-Ru ALD cycle ratio. The catalysts were tested toward the CO oxidation and methanol oxidation reaction (MOR) in a three-electrode electrochemical set-up. For the compositions investigated, the catalysts with a Ru content of 29at.% exhibited highest catalytic activity.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Johansson, Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","Larsen, Jackie Vincent","Verheijen, Marcel A.","Haugshøj, Kenneth B.","F. Clausen, Henrik","Kessels, Wilhelmus M.M.","Christensen, Leif Højslet","Thomsen, Erik Vilain"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-336411"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Eindhoven University of Technology"],"keyword":["ALD","CO oxidation","DMFC","MOR"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"electrocatalytic activity of atomic layer deposited pt ru catalysts onto n doped carbon nanotubes","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2014.01.001","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-336411","identifier":[{"id":"84893274227","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-6aa1e604-65ee-4719-8fba-68e76a4c9997"],"keyword":["ALD","CO oxidation","DMFC","MOR","N-doped CNT","Pt–Ru"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8A8E99B1198F87D1105ADD176E065128"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2014.01.001","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Micro- and Nanotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"eindhoven university of technology","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Eindhoven University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","key":"johanssonpau","last":"Johansson","locid":"d3015f26-124b-4af0-ae58-aac640ebeec0","name":"Johansson, Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jackie Vincent","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"1a230176-2f1e-4133-a820-8e549ac15d87","name":"Larsen, Jackie Vincent","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marcel A.","key":"verheijenpau","last":"Verheijen","name":"Verheijen, Marcel A.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Kenneth B.","key":"haugshøjpau","last":"Haugshøj","name":"Haugshøj, Kenneth B.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"fclausenpau","last":"F. Clausen","name":"F. Clausen, Henrik","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Wilhelmus M.M.","key":"kesselspau","last":"Kessels","name":"Kessels, Wilhelmus M.M.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Leif Højslet","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Leif Højslet","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik Vilain","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"822fe159-0932-4e5e-aeb6-b8b7f8421ab0","name":"Thomsen, Erik Vilain","orcid":"0000-0002-2772-926X","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jcat.2014.01.001","issn":["00219517","10902694"],"issn_org":["00219517"],"journal":"Journal of Catalysis","pages":"481-486","publisher":"Academic Press","status":"p","title":"Journal of Catalysis","volume":"311"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84893274227"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-6aa1e604-65ee-4719-8fba-68e76a4c9997"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Electrocatalytic activity of atomic layer deposited Pt–Ru catalysts onto N-doped carbon nanotubes","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-336411","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Two new cytochalasins, sclerotionigrin A (1) and B (2) were isolated together with the known proxiphomin (3) from the filamentous fungus Aspergillus sclerotioniger. The structures and relative stereochemistry of 1 and 2 were determined based on comparison with 3, and from extensive 1D and 2D NMR spectroscopic analysis, supported by high resolution mass spectrometry (HRMS). Compounds 2 and 3 displayed cytotoxic activity towards chronic lymphocytic leukemia cells in vitro, with 3 being the most active.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Petersen, Lene Maj","Bladt, Tanja Thorskov","Duerr, Claudia","Seiffert, Martina","Frisvad, Jens Christian","Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-338673"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","German Cancer Research Center"],"keyword":["Aspergillus flavipes","CELLS","Chemistry","Chronic lymphocytic leukemia","Cytochalasins","Fermentation","Inhibitor","Penicillium","elegans","endophytic fungus"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"isolation structural analyses and biological activity assays against chronic lymphocytic leukemia of two novel cytochalasins sclerotionigrin a and b","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/101031880/molecules_19_09786_v2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-338673","identifier":[{"id":"25006786","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84904807843","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-724412d1-5915-4639-bc77-28606bee06ef"],"keyword":["ASPERGILLUS-FLAVIPES","ASPOCHALASIN-I","Apsergillus sclerotioniger","CELLS","CHEMISTRY,","CLAVATUS","ELEGANS","ENDOPHYTIC FUNGUS","FERMENTATION","INHIBITOR","PENICILLIUM","STRUCTURAL analysis (Science)","TERREUS","apergilli","chronic lymphocytic leukemia","cytochalasins"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D6A7740F2E8E17667413145D753FE0AC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules19079786","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/101031880/molecules_19_09786_v2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"german cancer research center","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"German Cancer Research Center","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene Maj","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"7a1c5a02-7eb8-40e3-a1ec-621fb3c37652","name":"Petersen, Lene Maj","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tanja Thorskov","key":"bladtpau","last":"Bladt","locid":"f3901515-2083-40bb-a1e7-4ef23deb7e31","name":"Bladt, Tanja Thorskov","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Claudia","key":"duerrpau","last":"Duerr","name":"Duerr, Claudia","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Martina","key":"seiffertpau","last":"Seiffert","name":"Seiffert, Martina","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Christian","key":"frisvadpau","last":"Frisvad","locid":"b2d4f948-9e1c-4f8c-9c02-05588bfa21b9","name":"Frisvad, Jens Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-0573-4340","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Held","key":"gotfredsenpau","last":"Gotfredsen","locid":"1cf4df84-2d0e-4693-bf47-e9932e3bf0e3","name":"Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","orcid":"0000-0002-7386-119X","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas Ostenfeld","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"bd958d52-71b6-4720-b30a-cc9305633b43","name":"Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld","orcid":"0000-0002-3362-5707","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25006786"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3390/molecules19079786","issn":["14203049","14315157"],"issn_org":["14203049"],"issue":"7","journal":"Molecules","pages":"9786-9797","publisher":"MDPI AG","publisher_org":"M D P I AG","status":"p","title":"Molecules","volume":"19"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84904807843"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-724412d1-5915-4639-bc77-28606bee06ef"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Isolation, Structural Analyses and Biological Activity Assays against Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia of Two Novel Cytochalasins - Sclerotionigrin A and B","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-338673","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Til at afgøre om Porcin Reproduktions- og Respiratorisk Syndrom Virus (PRRSV) cirkulerer i farestalden eller kun i smågrisestalden kan næsesvaberprøver af alle grise ved fravænning være en hjælp. Resultatet fra et enkelt fravænningshold kan dog ikke stå alene, når det skal afgøres om en tømning af smågrisestalden er tilstrækkeligt for at der fremadrettet kan produceres PRRSV-negative grise ved 30 kg. Det vil ofte være nødvendigt at tage næsesvaberprøver af alle grise i flere fravænningshold.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Kristensen, Charlotte Sonne","Larsen, Lars Erik","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-352775"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-AAF","DI-PR-ALL"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-AAF","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"svært at afgøre om grise smittes med prrsv før eller efter fravænning","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/103606048/Erfaring_1420_Sv_rt_at_afg_re_om_grise_smittes_med_PRRS_f_r_eller_efter_frav_nning.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-352775","ids":["dtu-a18c486a-3307-4e2f-ab56-e5f253411e36"],"lang":"English","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1B3448DDF0C220EAC7E40633949E845C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/103606048/Erfaring_1420_Sv_rt_at_afg_re_om_grise_smittes_med_PRRS_f_r_eller_efter_frav_nning.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"danish agriculture food council","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-AAF","l3nl":"Danish Agriculture & Food Council","l3nn":"Danish Agriculture & Food Council","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Agriculture & Food Council","namevar":["Danish Agriculture and Food Council"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-AAF","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute, Section for Virology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte Sonne","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","name":"Kristensen, Charlotte Sonne","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"09c2a33d-b353-44de-a850-f3c7dec879cb","name":"Larsen, Lars Erik","orcid":"0000-0003-0730-5555","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Kristiane","key":"hjulsagerpau","last":"Hjulsager","locid":"6c1511ef-8211-4653-8c81-cd55b7f63f64","name":"Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","orcid":"0000-0001-7557-8876","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"Videncenter for Svineproduktion","status":"p","volume":"1420"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Danish Agriculture & Food Council","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-a18c486a-3307-4e2f-ab56-e5f253411e36"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Svært at afgøre om grise smittes med PRRSV før eller efter fravænning","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-352775","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"This article describes the fabrication and characterization of a silicon based micro direct methanol fuel cell using a Nafion ionomer membrane integrated into a perforated silicon plate. The focus of this work is to provide a platform for micro- and nanostructuring of a combined current collector and catalytic electrode. AC impedance spectroscopy is utilized alongside IV characterization to determine the influence of the plate perforation geometries on the cell performance. It is found that higher ratios of perforation increases peak power density, with the highest achieved being 2.5 mW cm−2 at a perforation ratio of 40.3%. The presented fuel cells also show a high volumetric peak power density of 2 mW cm−3 in light of the small system volume of 480 μL, while being fully self contained and passively feed.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Larsen, Jackie Vincent","Dalslet, Bjarke Thomas","Johansson, Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","Kallesøe, C.","Thomsen, Erik Vilain"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-353450"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Electrochemical impedance spectroscopy","Fuel cells","Methanol","PEM","Silicon"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"micro direct methanol fuel cell with perforated silicon plate integrated ionomer membrane","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2014.01.113","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-353450","identifier":[{"id":"84894634334","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-a3db83d1-c12f-4e04-8457-9d8a426b23f3"],"keyword":["Electrochemical impedance spectroscopy","Fuel cells","Methanol","PEM","Silicon"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BCACDAAE4A3AD44B6F142DB2941D385E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2014.01.113","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Micro- and Nanotechnology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Micro- and Nanotechnology, Optofluidics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jackie Vincent","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"1a230176-2f1e-4133-a820-8e549ac15d87","name":"Larsen, Jackie Vincent","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bjarke Thomas","key":"dalsletpau","last":"Dalslet","locid":"8ce80c37-4519-406c-b250-5058a0b76e28","name":"Dalslet, Bjarke Thomas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","key":"johanssonpau","last":"Johansson","locid":"d3015f26-124b-4af0-ae58-aac640ebeec0","name":"Johansson, Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"C.","key":"kallesøepau","last":"Kallesøe","name":"Kallesøe, C.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik Vilain","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"822fe159-0932-4e5e-aeb6-b8b7f8421ab0","name":"Thomsen, Erik Vilain","orcid":"0000-0002-2772-926X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2014.01.113","issn":["03787753","18732755"],"issn_org":["03787753"],"journal":"Journal of Power Sources","pages":"237-245","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Journal of Power Sources","volume":"257"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84894634334"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-a3db83d1-c12f-4e04-8457-9d8a426b23f3"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Micro direct methanol fuel cell with perforated silicon-plate integrated ionomer membrane","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-353450","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Denne rapport opsummerer faldvildtundersøgelserne, der er udført ved DTU Veterinærinstituttet (DTU-VET) i 2014. Resultaterne vil indgå i årsrapporten, der bliver tilgængelig på www.vildtsundhed.dk. Hvalpesyge epidemien, der startede i 2012, påvirker stadig rovdyrene i 2014 og det blev påvist i 2014 i grævling for første gang i denne epidemi. Der modtaget mange rådyr til undersøgelse, der giver et godt kendskab til de problemer der ses i bestanden. Der er fortsat mange rådyr med dårlige tænder og deraf følgende ringe kondition på grund af mange gamle dyr i bestandene. Der blev gennemført en undersøgelse af snabelklove hos rådyr, da denne tilstand ses relativt hyppigt. Materialet er indsamlet over flere år, og afslørede at mange klovben er drejede. En lignende tilstand kendes fra heste og kvæg efter pludselige foderskift eller fodring med for store mængder energi og resulterer i snabelklove/-hove. Det hyppige fund af drejede klovben hos rådyr kunne tyde i samme retning. I 2014 fandt det første udbrud af influenza A virus blandt spættede sæler sted i Europa. Dette udbrud centrerede sig omkring Danmark og resulterede i stor dødelighed blandt sælerne pga. samtidig bakteriel lungebetændelse. Udbruddet startede i april i Sverige og sluttede i efteråret i Holland. Der var under udbruddet ingen tegn på smitte til gråsæler. Den zoonotiske parasit Echinococcus multilocularis er igen i år påvist i ræve og for første gang er parasitten påvist hos 2 mårhunde. Der mærkes en stor interesse fra borgere og medier omkring sundhedstilstanden i den vilde fauna gennem indsendelse af mange dyr – og en bred vifte af arter, men også gennem mediernes bevågenhed ved fund af faldvildt.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Chriél, Mariann","Hansen, Mette Sif","Larsen, Gitte","Holm, Elisabeth","Jensen, Tim Kåre","Enemark, Heidi L.","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Al-Sabi, Mohammad Nafi Solaiman"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-364303"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rapportering af diagnostiske undersøgelser af faldvildt 000000002014","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/111791555/_rsrapport_vildt_2014_til_Vildtsundhed.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-364303","ids":["dtu-c802227a-2d7f-4ebb-8a17-d84a24a3566c"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-34A90FC9FE9FEF821FF1C22063C7F91B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/111791555/_rsrapport_vildt_2014_til_Vildtsundhed.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mariann","key":"chriélpau","last":"Chriél","locid":"1a5d6261-6bd2-4940-baab-5d5fcc3c0f7c","name":"Chriél, Mariann","orcid":"0000-0001-5306-4495","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mette Sif","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"5d04b165-7fc1-46cf-88f7-35be695b954c","name":"Hansen, Mette Sif","orcid":"0000-0002-8132-8475","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gitte","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"ea426e5f-93bd-48f5-a3c8-e5f8004413a7","name":"Larsen, Gitte","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Elisabeth","key":"holmpau","last":"Holm","locid":"07c945b3-4fe0-496a-9734-095800683729","name":"Holm, Elisabeth","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tim Kåre","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"2b93571f-6d81-4827-b040-467f1dee1c12","name":"Jensen, Tim Kåre","orcid":"0000-0002-8048-4695","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Heidi","key":"enemarkpau","last":"Enemark","locid":"0e5ce9a6-44a2-4d11-9595-32d55ac94d84","name":"Enemark, Heidi L.","name_org":"Enemark, Heidi","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Kristiane","key":"hjulsagerpau","last":"Hjulsager","locid":"6c1511ef-8211-4653-8c81-cd55b7f63f64","name":"Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","orcid":"0000-0001-7557-8876","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mohammad Nafi Solaiman","key":"alsabipau","last":"Al-Sabi","locid":"68d1a102-0f47-4fe0-ab67-15a80fe502de","name":"Al-Sabi, Mohammad Nafi Solaiman","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"26","publisher":"DTU Veterinærinstituttet","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-c802227a-2d7f-4ebb-8a17-d84a24a3566c"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Rapportering af diagnostiske undersøgelser af faldvildt 2014","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-364303","year":"2014","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Objectives To describe the development of acronym use across five major medical specialties and to evaluate the technical and aesthetic quality of the acronyms. Design Acronyms obtained through a literature search of Pubmed.gov followed by a standardised assessment of acronym quality (BEAUTY and CHEATING criteria). Participants Randomised controlled trials within psychiatry, rheumatology, pulmonary medicine, endocrinology, and cardiology published between 2000 and 2012. Main outcome measures Prevalence proportion of acronyms and composite quality score for acronyms over time. Results 14 965 publications were identified, of which 18.3% (n=2737) contained an acronym in the title. Acronym use was more common among cardiological studies than among the other four medical specialties (40% v 8-15% in 2012, P<0.001). Except for within cardiology, the prevalence of acronyms increased over time, with the average prevalence proportion among the remaining four specialties increasing from 4.0% to 12.4% from 2000 to 2012 (P<0.001). The median combined acronym quality score decreased significantly over the study period (P<0.001), from a median 9.25 in 2000 to 5.50 in 2012. Conclusion From 2000 to 2012 the prevalence of acronyms in trial reports increased, coinciding with a substantial decrease in the technical and aesthetic quality of the acronyms. Strict enforcement of current guidelines on acronym construction by journal editors is necessary to ensure the proper use of acronyms in the future.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Pottegård, Anton","Haastrup, Maija Bruun","Stage, Tore Bjerregaard","Hansen, Morten Rix","Larsen, Kasper Søltoft","Meegaard, P. M.","Meegaard, L. H.","Horneberg, H.","Gils, Charlotte","Dideriksen, Dorthe","Aagaard, Lise","Almarsdóttir, Anna Birna","Hallas, Jesper","Damkier, Per"],"cuid":["S02-087.87-666776"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"search for humouristic and extravagant acronyms and thoroughly inappropriate names for important clinical trials scientific qualitative and quantitative systematic study","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.g7092","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-087.87-666776","identifier":[{"id":"25516539","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84919904545","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-0eadb702-b91a-4362-84c4-135ae3f41679","sdu-b3823190-50b4-401f-8563-6f070b8279da"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-823DDC5E09CAED4AD6EE0D288FF50183"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.g7092","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/229320026/bmj.g7092.full.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Clinical Pharmacology and Pharmacy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Drug Design and Pharmacology, Department of Drug Design and Pharmacology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anton","key":"pottegårdantonpau","last":"Pottegård","locid":"addfc2c1-4fc9-44cd-8087-bce3bc986652","name":"Pottegård, Anton","orcid":"0000-0001-9314-5679","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"M. B.","key":"haastrupmaijabruunpau","last":"Haastrup","locid":"8449006f-7fb6-43b1-b126-0c07acab539e","name":"Haastrup, Maija Bruun","name_org":"Haastrup, M. B.","orcid":"0000-0002-1776-4846","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"T. B.","key":"stagetorebjerregaardpau","last":"Stage","locid":"b794c141-d9c5-4082-b8c5-b69f854d4c7c","name":"Stage, Tore Bjerregaard","name_org":"Stage, T. B.","orcid":"0000-0002-4698-4389","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten Rix","key":"hansenmortenrixpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"58ab7b9c-6262-468d-91d6-247ef0076e29","name":"Hansen, Morten Rix","orcid":"0000-0002-1582-7866","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kasper Søltoft","key":"larsenkaspersøltoftpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"804c07a1-42c5-4d27-bbb3-2011ab0cedd2","name":"Larsen, Kasper Søltoft","orcid":"0000-0002-1111-8050","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Peter Martin","key":"meegaardpetermartinpau","last":"Meegaard","locid":"d27b8fa3-5f92-4ac3-9126-9dd081acaafa","name":"Meegaard, Peter Martin","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"P. M.","key":"meegaardpmpau","last":"Meegaard","name":"Meegaard, P. M.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Line Haugaard Vrdlovec","key":"meegaardlinehaugaardvrdlovecpau","last":"Meegaard","name":"Meegaard, Line Haugaard Vrdlovec","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"L. H.","key":"meegaardlh