{"abstract":"enne rapport udgør DTU Veterinærinstituttets årsrapport vedrørende diagnostiske undersøgelser af pelsdyr og en kort opremsning af igangværende forskningsaktiviteter ved sektionen. Afrapporteringen for minkdiagnostikken følger mink-året – det vil sige fra november 2013 til udgangen oktober 2014.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Chriél, Mariann","Hansen, Mette Sif","Larsen, Gitte","Holm, Elisabeth","Jensen, Tim Kåre","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Strandbygaard, Bertel","Enemark, Heidi L."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-333119"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"diagnostiske undersøgelser af pelsdyr ved dtu veterinærinstituttet november 000000002013 oktober 000000002014","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-333119","ids":["dtu-5fdee665-3a88-4723-bc89-b9bee4d4d65d"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2B0C00B4E79DCEA79ADDEDF7D8EA8CAB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mariann","key":"chriélpau","last":"Chriél","locid":"1a5d6261-6bd2-4940-baab-5d5fcc3c0f7c","name":"Chriél, Mariann","orcid":"0000-0001-5306-4495","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mette Sif","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","lo