{"author_count":5,"contributors":["Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Krog, Jesper Schak","Madsen, Jesper Johannes","Thorup, Kasper","Larsen, Lars Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-542645"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"overvågning af aviær influenza i vilde fugle i danmark 000000002013","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://orbit.dtu.dk/en/publications/overvaagning-af-aviaer-influenza-i-vilde-fugle-i-danmark-2013(553729fd-2795-4eac-a192-5670a63d88d7).html","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-542645","ids":["ku-f9fe33ca-0cfc-4b82-9157-ab2bdcdb3fc6"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-96D00F29ABF879526D4AE2D26225B544"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, The Natural History Museum, Natural History Museum of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Charlotte Kristiane","key":"hjulsagerpau","last":"Hjulsager","name":"Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper Schak","key":"krogpau","last":"Krog","name":"Krog, Jesper Schak","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jesper Johannes","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"d82924e0-e9c4-4f0c-b403-a2f210e07b58","name":"Madsen, Jesper Johannes","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Kasper","key":"thoruppau","last":"Thorup","locid":"d93b22de-bf1d-45f5-bcea-9dacd45b6420","name":"Thorup, Kasper","orcid":"0000-0002-0320-0601","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lars Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Lars Erik","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"27","publisher":"Veterinærinstituttet, Danmarks Tekniske Universitet","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-f9fe33ca-0cfc-4b82-9157-ab2bdcdb3fc6"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Overvågning af aviær influenza i vilde fugle i Danmark 2013","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-542645","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"A Trypanosoma cruzi trans-sialidase (E.C. 3.2.1.18) was cloned into Pichia pastoris and expressed. The pH and temperature optimum of the enzyme was determined as pH 5.7 and 30°C. Using casein glycomacropeptide (CGMP) and lactose as sialyl-donor and acceptor respectively, the optimal donor/acceptor ratio for the trans-sialidase catalysed 3′-sialyllactose production was found to be 1:4. Quantitative amounts of 3′-sialyllactose were produced from CGMP and lactose at a yield of 40mg/g CGMP. The 3′-sialyllactose obtained exerted a stimulatory effect on selected probiotic strains, including different Bifidobacterium strains in single culture fermentations. The trans-sialidase also catalysed the transfer of sialic acid from CGMP to galacto-oligosaccharides (GOS) and to the human milk oligosaccharide (HMO) backbone lacto-N-tetraose (LNT) to produce 3′-sialyl-GOS, including doubly sialylated GOS products, and 3′-sialyl-LNT, respectively. This work thus provides proof of the concept of producing 3′-sialyllactose and potentially other sialylated HMOs as well as sialylated GOS enzymatically by trans-sialidase activity, while at the same time providing valorisation of CGMP, a co-processing product from cheese manufacture.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Holck, Jesper","Larsen, Dorte Møller","Michalak, Malwina","Li, Haiying","Kjærulff, Louise","Kirpekar, Finn","Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","Forssten, Sofia","Ouwehand, Arthur C.","Mikkelsen, Jørn Dalgaard","Meyer, Anne S."],"cuid":["S02-099.77-034994"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Meyer, Anne S."],"country":["Finland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","DuPont Nutrition and Health"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-DUP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-DUP","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"enzyme catalysed production of sialylated human milk oligosaccharides and galactooligosaccharides by trypanosoma cruzi trans sialidase","src":["dtu","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nbt.2013.11.006","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-099.77-034994","identifier":[{"id":"84893741493","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24316323","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-688fff69-da2d-4763-8893-8e6b2fb3a489","sdu-a0f6743e-ec54-4e39-a874-160c4627e656"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-BD9BE3FAE43E31A594937F6758AC18E5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84893741493&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nbt.2013.11.006","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering, Center for BioProcess Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Science, De