{"abstract":"En ny kortlægning af mulighederne for Open Access til artikler publiceret af professionshøjskolernes medarbejdere i danske og nordiske tidsskrifter viser, at der kan opnås fuldtekstadgang til over 75 % af artiklerne. Cirka halvdelen af tidsskrifterne tillader imidlertid ikke Open Access eller mangler viden om fænomenet.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Greve, Charlotte","Larsen, Birgit"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-656093"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Informationsvidenskab"],"level":"sci","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"stort potentiale for open access i professionshøjskolerne","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.via.dk/ws/files/15690744/Stort_potentiale_for_Open_Access_i_professionsh_jskolerne.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-656093","ids":["via-2ada3e60-fdf7-41ac-bb2d-3b5ba4686fab"],"keyword":["informationsvidenskab"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-486EA40483521A75C4422DB02A2053C9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.via.dk/ws/files/15690744/Stort_potentiale_for_Open_Access_i_professionsh_jskolerne.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Bibliotek"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"grevepau","last":"Greve","locid":"37958a4e-e0bc-43fa-bf6a-8056a8f94b84","name":"Greve, Charlotte