{"abstract":"A tramp ship operator typically has some contracted cargoes that must be carried and seeks to maximize proFIt by carrying optional cargoes. Hence, tramp ships operate much like taxies following available cargoes and not according to a fixed route network and itinerary as liner ships. Marine fuel is referred to as bunker and bunker costs constitute a significant part of the daily operating costs. There can be great variations in bunker prices across bunker ports so it is important to carefully plan bunkering for each ship. As ships operate 24 hours a day, they must refuel during operations. Therefore, route and schedule decisions affect the options for bunkering. Current practice is, however, to separate the two planning problems by first constructing fleet schedules and then plan bunkering for these fixed schedules. In this paper we explore the effects of integrating bunker planning in the routing and scheduling phase and present a mixed integer programming formulation for the integrated problem of optimally routing, scheduling and bunkering a tramp fleet. Aside from the integration of bunker, this model also extends standard tramp formulations by using load dependent costs, speed and bunker consumption. We devise a solution method based on column generation with a dynamic programming algorithm to generate columns. The method is heuristic mainly due to a discretization of the continuous bunker purchase variables. We show that the integrated planning approach can increase profits and that the decision of which cargoes to carry and on which ships is affected by the bunker integration and by changes in the bunker prices.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Vilhelmsen, Charlotte","Lusby, Richard Martin","Larsen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-322473"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"routing and scheduling in tramp shipping integrating bunker optimization technical report","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/97402032/Routing_and_Scheduling_in_Tramp_Shipping.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-322473","ids":["dtu-3c1be1f3-98c1-40e6-bfd0-d9df4a976afa"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3E96D4510B07042C508DEB9664D9BC23"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/97402032/Routing_and_Scheduling_in_Tramp_Shipping.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Management Engineering, Management Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"vilhelmsenpau","last":"Vilhelmsen","locid":"6ceebc69-a38c-4b56-9070-23135aa491c6","name":"Vilhelmsen, Charlotte","orcid":"0000-0001-8260-6791","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Richard Martin","key":"lusbypau","last":"Lusby","locid":"51599544-7991-404d-b9a7-ec2f5ad4824b","name":"Lusby, Richard Martin","orcid":"0000-0002-8652-6219","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"d1af4d26-e92b-414c-b534-25b2b607a0d9","name":"Larsen, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0002-9119-3586","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"24","publisher":"DTU Management Engineering","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","sdg":["14. Life Below Water","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-3c1be1f3-98c1-40e6-bfd0-d9df4a976afa"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Routing and Scheduling in Tramp Shipping - Integrating Bunker Optimization : Technical report","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-322473","year":"2013","yearsub":"2014"}
