{"abstract":"Henrik Smith-Sivertsen bruger Povl Dissings “Lad mig blive noget” som udgangspunkt for en række diskussioner. Den første handler om versioneringspraksisser, dvs. oversættelser af udenlandske sange, og indeholder en analyse af forholdet mellem kopi og original samt de ejerskabsforhold og autenticitetsforestillinger, som uafværgeligt bliver tematiseret i oversættelsen. Den anden handler om de krydsninger mellem høj og lav, let og seriøs, som indspilningen indeholder. Tekstforfatter var Thøger Olesen, producer var Gustav Winckler, backing bandet var de psykedeliske The Beefeaters og forsanger var folk-musikeren Povl Dissing. En pointe er, at en opdeling i klart adskilte musikkulturer ikke holder for en nærmere analyse.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Smith-Sivertsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-549128"],"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Populærmusik","Rockhistorie"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"lad mig blive noget originalitets og autenticitetsforestillinger i det populærmusikalske felt","src":["kum"],"src-code":["DI-GV-KUM"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-549128","ids":["kum-7090a1ce-4fa0-4f7b-b1e1-a49ff199bade"],"keyword":["Authenticitet","Populærmusik","Rockhistorie"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-644394A9D89805C0848FE16F8E127E4E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kum ministry of culture archives museums and royal library denmark","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-KUM","l3nn":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","namevar":["Ministry of Culture Denmark, The Royal Library"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-KUM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"smithsivertsenpau","last":"Smith-Sivertsen","locid":"7a9d3028-cb24-4e43-bb57-9c6d8f768a83","name":"Smith-Sivertsen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6132-0487","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten","key":"michelsenpedh","last":"Michelsen","name":"Michelsen, Morten","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Charlotte","key":"rørdamlarsenpedh","last":"Rørdam Larsen","name":"Rørdam Larsen, Charlotte","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Annemette","key":"kirkegaardpedh","last":"Kirkegaard,","name":"Kirkegaard,, Annemette","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Lisbeth","key":"ihlemannpedh","last":"Ihlemann","name":"Ihlemann, Lisbeth","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Gestur","key":"gudmundssonpedh","last":"Gudmundsson","name":"Gudmundsson, Gestur","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik","key":"bødkerpedh","last":"Bødker","name":"Bødker, Henrik","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["978 87 7674 668 1"],"issn":["16025962"],"pages":"175-221","publisher":"Syddansk Universitetsforlag","series":"University of Southern Denmark Studies in History and Social Sciences","status":"p","title":"Rock i Danmark: Studier i populærmusik fra 1950'erne til årtusindskiftet"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","Governmental Institutions"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kum-7090a1ce-4fa0-4f7b-b1e1-a49ff199bade"],"src":["KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark"],"title":"“Lad mig blive noget” : Originalitets- og autentic