{"abstract":"Med Trængselskommissionens betænkning fremlægges en samlet strategi for modernisering af hovedstadsområdets transportsystem, der vil øge kapaciteten og styrke mobiliteten i hele hovedstadsområdet.","author_count":28,"contributors":["Larsen, Leo","Jespersen, Per Homann","Gammelgaard, Britta","Kristensen, Niels Buus","Nielsen, Otto Anker","Lahrmann, Harry","Skovbro, Anne","Christiansen, Steen","Toft, Hans","Holmer, Henrik","Stenild, Flemming","Gaardhøj, Lars","Østergaard, Erik","Svane, Michael","Friis-Mikkelsen, Christel","Vedel, Aino","Pedersen, Lise Bjørg","Møller Thomsen, Thomas","Nøhr Pedersen, Dorthe","Plougmann Olsen, Henrik","Lok, Jesper T.","Krawack, Susanne","Lund Pedersen, Ivan","Juncher Jørgensen, Trine","Vogt-Nielsen, Karl","Fischer, Charlotte","Jacobsen, Peter","Kabell, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-295043"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Københavns Kommune"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mobilitet og fremkommelighed i hovedstaden sammenfatning fra trængselskommissionen","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.trm.dk/da/publikationer/2013/traengselskommissionens-betaenkning-og-sammenfatning","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-295043","ids":["cbs-ce78ccd8-3c22-4adb-b9db-40451251cea5"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-46DEC719FF25FA7C761F777E579EEE7F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Privat