{"abstract":"We present atomic layer deposition (ALD) as a new method for the preparation of highly dispersed Ru-decorated Pt nanoparticles for use as catalyst in direct methanol fuel cells (DMFCs). The nanoparticles were deposited onto N-doped multi-walled carbon nanotubes (MWCNTs) at 250 °C using trimethyl(methylcyclopentadienyl)platinum MeCpPtMe3, bis(ethylcyclopentadienyl)ruthenium Ru(EtCp)2 and O2 as the precursors. Catalysts with 5, 10 and 20 ALD Ru cycles grown onto the CNT-supported ALD Pt nanoparticles (150 cycles) were prepared and tested towards the electro-oxidation of CO and methanol, using cyclic voltammetry and chronoamperometry in a three-electrode electrochemical set-up. The catalyst decorated with 5 ALD Ru cycles was of highest activity in both reactions, followed by the ones with 10 and 20 ALD Ru cycles. It is demonstrated that ALD is a promising technique in the field of catalysis as highly dispersed nanoparticles of controlled size and composition can be deposited, with up-scaling prospects.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Johansson, Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","Yang, R.B.","Haugshøj, K.B.","Larsen, Jackie Vincent","Christensen, Leif Højslet","Thomsen, Erik Vilain"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-369681"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Atomic layer deposition","DMFC"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ru decorated pt nanoparticles on n doped multi walled carbon nanotubes by atomic layer deposition for direct methanol fuel cells","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2013.06.089","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-369681","identifier":[{"id":"84882454612","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-d9c114f4-2f31-4b3d-8b9a-970d33daa5df"],"keyword":["Atomic layer deposition","DMFC","N-doped carbon nanotube","Ru-decorated Pt catalyst"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5E1E77140E8C51E71DE497A8C8436901"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2013.06.089","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Micro- and Nanotechnology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Micro- and Nanotechnology, MEMS-AppliedSensors"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","key":"johanssonpau","last":"Johansson","locid":"d3015f26-124b-4af0-ae58-aac640ebeec0","name":"Johansson, Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"R.B.","key":"yangpau","last":"Yang","name":"Yang, R.B.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"K.B.","key":"haugshøjpau","last":"Haugshøj","name":"Haugshøj, K.B.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jackie Vincent","key":"larsenpau"