{"abstract":"Chronic lymphocytic leukemia (CLL) is the most common leukemia in adults from the western world. No curative treatments of CLL are presently known so the treatment strategy today is primarily to prolong patient survival,1 why we have initiated new activities towards discovery of novel compounds with potential tumor specificity. Our starting point is a diverse fungal collection of thousands of Penicillium and Aspergillus species. These fungi have proven to be a very rich source of various bioactive compounds and yet our dereplication investigations have demonstrated that there are still numerous unknown compounds to be identified within these species. Until now we have found that 11 out of 289 fungal extracts are active against CLL cells. Using our established chemotaxonomic discovery approach we have dereplicated and fractionated these extracts to track the activity into single fractions/compounds.2,3 This includes analysis of the spectroscopic data generated from LC-DAD-MS to reveal whether the active principles are either structurally known compounds or are likely to be novel compounds. This paper will illustrate our integrated discovery approaches and recent findings of anti-leukemia compounds.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Bladt, Tanja Thorskov","Kildgaard, Sara","Knudsen, Peter Boldsen","Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","Duerr, C.","Seiffert, M.","Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-339845"],"event":{"end":"2012-08-01","place":"New York, NY, us","start":"2012-07-28","title":"International Congress on Natural Products Research on Global Change, Natural Products and Human Health/8th Joint Meeting of AFERP, ASP, GA, PSE and SIF","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","German Cancer Research Center"],"keyword":["Dereplication"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fungal natural products targeting chronic lymphocytic leukemia","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1055/s-0032-1320745","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-339845","ids":["dtu-761ba507-2c4d-4b32-a236-0e1bd564954c"],"keyword":["Dereplication"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-00F51D43C23AC4C09B234A94755FC1E8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1055/s-0032-1320745","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology, Center for Microbial Biotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"german cancer research center","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"German Cancer Research Center","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tanja Thorskov","key":"bladtpau","last":"Bladt","locid":"f3901515-2083-40bb-a1e7-4ef23deb7e31","name":"Bladt, Tanja Thorskov","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sara","key":"kildgaardpau","last":"Kildgaard","name":"Kildgaard, Sara","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Boldsen","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"991df7f2-a085-49ce-a926-da127ba3b28b","name":"Knudsen, Peter Boldsen","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Held","key":"gotfredsenpau","last":"Gotfredsen","locid":"1cf4df84-2d0e-4693-bf47-e9932e3bf0e3","name":"Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","orcid":"0000-0002-7386-119X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"C.","key":"duerrpau","last":"Duerr","name":"Duerr, C.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"M.","key":"seiffertpau","last":"Seiffert","name":"Seiffert, M.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas Ostenfeld","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"bd958d52-71b6-4720-b30a-cc9305633b43","name":"Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld","orcid":"0000-0002-3362-5707","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1055/s-0032-1320745","issn":["00320943","14390221"],"issn_org":["00320943"],"issue":"11","journal":"Planta Medica","pages":"1158-1158","publisher":"Georg Thieme Verlag","status":"p","title":"Planta Medica","volume":"78"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-761ba507-2c4d-4b32-a236-0e1bd564954c"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Fungal natural products targeting chronic lymphocytic leukemia","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-339845","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Polyketides (PKs) and non-ribosomal peptides (NRPs) constitute large classes of diverse secondary metabolites (SMs) and are important sources for pharmaceuticals due to their structural diversity and wide variety of biological activities. Our investigation of the chemical profile of the industrially important black Aspergillus Aspergillus aculeatus by UHPLC-DAD-HRMS has identified several SMs already known from this organism. However, several compounds could not be unambiguously dereplicated wherefore some have been selected, purified and structure elucidated by 1D and 2D NMR spectroscopy, whereby several novel secondary metabolites have been discovered. A. aculeatus has recently been genome-sequenced; however no genetic approaches have so far been described to facilitate genetic engineering. We here present a system for non-integrated (AMA1-based) gene expression in A. aculeatus based on the USERTM cloning technique. The AMA-1 based gene expression has successfully been applied to express genes in A. aculeatus and by this approach the function of a PKS gene has been established. Furthermore the technique was used to activate a silent cluster by expression of a transcription factor, leading to the production of two previously unknown compounds, which we propose to be of meroterpenoid origin.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Petersen, Lene Maj","Holm, Dorte Koefoed","Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-347452"],"event":{"end":"2012-08-01","place":"New York City, NY, us","start":"2012-07-28","title":"International Congress on Natural Products Research on Global Change, Natural Products and Human Health","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"discovery of novel secondary metabolites in aspergillus aculeatus","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1055/s-0032-1320755","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-347452","ids":["dtu-8fbdfd92-e6be-4a2c-9951-3bfc2e6487d3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-55B3B0FD16774A22F948AC07945AA451"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1055/s-0032-1320755","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology, Center for Microbial Biotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene Maj","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"7a1c5a02-7eb8-40e3-a1ec-621fb3c37652","name":"Petersen, Lene Maj","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Dorte Koefoed","key":"holmpau","last":"Holm","locid":"aedc7b19-7dd8-4af4-a8cc-5a73f5783c91","name":"Holm, Dorte Koefoed","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Held","key":"gotfredsenpau","last":"Gotfredsen","locid":"1cf4df84-2d0e-4693-bf47-e9932e3bf0e3","name":"Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","orcid":"0000-0002-7386-119X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas Ostenfeld","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"bd958d52-71b6-4720-b30a-cc9305633b43","name":"Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld","orcid":"0000-0002-3362-5707","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1055/s-0032-1320755","issn":["00320943","14390221"],"issn_org":["00320943"],"issue":"11","journal":"Planta Medica","pages":"1159-1160","publisher":"Georg Thieme Verlag","status":"p","title":"Planta Medica","volume":"78"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-8fbdfd92-e6be-4a2c-9951-3bfc2e6487d3"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Discovery of novel secondary metabolites in Aspergillus aculeatus","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-347452","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Konklusionen af at følge en dansk slagtesvinebesætning, som fra start så ud til at være PCV2-fri gennem en periode på to år var, at besætningen ikke var fri for PCV2 i hele perioden. Der var svingninger i PCV2-niveauet over tid. PCV2 blev påvist ved to lejligheder, og begge gange var påvisningen sammenfaldende med, at grisene i præcist de hold, som de eneste hold i perioden, ikke var vaccineret mod PCV2. Første gang PCV2 blev påvist havde besætningen samtidig et udbrud af PRRS, men da PCV2 vaccination blev genindført kunne PCV2 ikke længere påvises. Anden gang PCV2 blev påvist kunne der ikke påvises PRRS. Alligevel havde grisene flere kliniske symptomer og der kunne efterfølgende påvises PCV2 i få grise i en længere periode. PCV2-vaccination ser ud til at kunne sænke PCV2-niveauet, også under et akut udbrud af PRRS. En anden, formodet PCV2 fri slagtesvinebesætning blev fulgt et år, men fik hurtigt påvist PCV2 i flere hold og udgik af undersøgelsen efter år 1.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Kristensen, Charlotte Sonne","Larsen, Lars Erik","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-366053"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"undersøgelse af pcv000000000002 status i to danske besætninger to års opfølgning","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://vsp.lf.dk/da-DK/Publikationer/Kilder/lu_medd/2012/933.aspx","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-366053","ids":["dtu-cdfe7e20-3ffb-4f72-8ae9-fc5a965f5239"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A57F1D33D32AF2A21B977C8F8F1D3961"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http:/