{"abstract":"In 2010 the five Danish regions and the National Institute of Public Health at the University of Southern Denmark conducted a national representative health survey among the adult population in Denmark. This paper describes the study design and the sample and study population as well as the content of the questionnaire.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Christensen, Anne Illemann","Ekholm, Ola","Glümer, Charlotte","Andreasen, Anne Helms","Hvidberg, Michael Falk","Kristensen, Peter Lund","Larsen, Finn Breinholt","Ortiz, Britta","Juel, Knud"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-604155"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Adolescent","Adult","Aged","Aged 80 and over","Cross Sectional Studies","Denmark","Epidemiologic Research Design","Female","Health Status","Health Surveys","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Public health","Questionnaires","Research Design","Young Adult"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Faggruppen for Folkesundhedsvidenskab og Epidemiologi"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the danish national health survey 000000002010 study design and respondent characteristics","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/1403494812451412","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-604155","identifier":[{"id":"22786925","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84863836646","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-6c442cff-92d9-4453-a41d-7084df386720"],"keyword":["Adolescent","Adult","Aged","Aged, 80 and over","Cross-Sectional Studies","Denmark","Epidemiologic Research Design","Female","Health Status","Health Surveys","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Public Health","Questionnaires","Research Design","Young Adult"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Med