{"abstract":"ABSTRACT: We report an unusual case of HIV-related immune reconstitution inflammatory syndrome, presenting as suspected AIDS-related lymphoma. Symptoms, initial investigations including fine-needle biopsy and 18F-FDG PET/CT scan were highly compatible with high grade AIDS-related lymphoma, however subsequently IRIS was diagnosed. We discuss pitfalls in the interpretation of diagnostic results in ARL versus IRIS.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Mortensen, Bo Kok","Nielsen, Susanne D","Christensen, Charlotte B","Helweg-Larsen, Jannik","Christensen, Charlotte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-543727"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"immune reconstitution syndrome presenting as probable aids related lymphoma a case report","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1742-6405-8-34","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-543727","identifier":[{"id":"80053342823","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-fbc1ca47-fa72-4799-81f7-84e61e88a5ac"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1AAB3B2F15D0CAE76ECCC0D02347985A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1742-6405-8-34","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Surgery and Internal Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Bo K","key":"mortensenbokokpau","last":"Mortensen","locid":"ef0f54c4-15a2-47dd-ab77-262a660864dd","name":"Mortensen, Bo Kok","name_org":"Mortensen, Bo K","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Susanne D","key":"nielsensusannedpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Susanne D","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Charlotte B","key":"christensencharlottebpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Charlotte B","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jannik","key":"helweglarsenjannikpau","last":"Helweg-Larsen","locid":"6031d979-32ba-4050-8508-152a14bb98b6","name":"Helweg-Larsen, Jannik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Charlotte","key":"christensencharlottepau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Charlotte","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1186/1742-6405-8-34","issn":["17426405"],"journal":"AIDS Research and Therapy","pages":"34","status":"p","title":"AIDS Research and Therapy","volume":"8"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80053342823"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-fbc1ca47-fa72-4799-81f7-84e61e88a5ac"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Immune reconstitution syndrome presenting as probable AIDS-related lymphoma: a case report","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-543727","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
