,"last":"Kanstrup","name":"Kanstrup, Inge-Lis","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Bo","key":"zerahnpau","last":"Zerahn","name":"Zerahn, Bo","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"ekdahlpau","last":"Ekdahl","name":"Ekdahl, Charlotte","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kurt","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"f8a07351-d436-44c5-b0d3-9cd052bbc89f","name":"Jensen, Kurt","orcid":"0000-0001-9014-2093","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Holsgaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"3c1cf5a4-81b1-49f3-ad79-d086b74b1561","name":"Holsgaard-Larsen, Anders","name_org":"Larsen, Anders Holsgaard","orcid":"0000-0003-4106-6930","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Per","key":"aagaardpau","last":"Aagaard","locid":"8452f86e-3c45-4ecb-9e11-54c72d45d669","name":"Aagaard, Per","orcid":"0000-0002-9773-7361","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["03063674","14730480"],"issn_org":["03063674"],"journal":"British Journal of Sports Medicine","pages":"381-382","publisher":"BMJ Publishing Group","status":"p","title":"British Journal of Sports Medicine","volume":"4"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-5a0e2a40-9d44-46bf-9aed-f5f25e12b659"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Neuromuscular activity and force production during slide-based and stationary ergometer rowing","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-599018","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"1. Running waters, including associated riparian areas, are embraced by international legal frameworks outlining targets for the preservation, protection and improvement of the quality of the environment. Interactions between stream and river processes and riparian habitats have not received much attention in the management of stream ecosystems, and integrated measures that consider both the ecological status of streams and rivers (sensu EU Water Framework Directive, WFD) and the conservation status of riparian habitats and species (sensu EU Habitats Directive, HD) are rare. 2. Here, we analysed the influence of stream size, morphology and chemical water characteristics for the distribution of water-dependent terrestrial habitat types, i.e. alkaline fens, periodically inundated meadows and meadows in riparian areas in Denmark using an extensive data set covering a total of 254 stream reaches. A species-based classification model was used to translate species lists into a standardised interpretation of habitat types protected by the HD in Denmark. 3. No size dependency was found regarding the distribution of fen and meadow vegetation. Instead, the distribution of fen and meadow vegetation was strongly affected by the morphology of the streams. Alkaline fens, periodically inundated meadows and meadows occurred six, five and four times, respectively, less frequently along channelised compared with natural stream reaches. Our results indicate that stream channelisation strongly interfered with the natural hydrology of riparian areas, affecting conditions needed to sustain protected fen and meadow communities. 4. We also found that water chemistry strongly influenced the occurrence of fen and meadow vegetation in riparian areas. The probability of finding fen and meadow vegetation was reduced when total phosphorus (TP) concentration exceeded 40–50 μg P L−1, whereas meadow vegetation responded less strongly to TP. 5. Our findings highlight the importance of restoring hydrology of riparian areas to improve conditions for fen and meadow vegetation, but also that the water chemistry should be considered when measures that increase hydrological connectivity result in an increase in the probability of flooding.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Baattrup-Pedersen, Annette","Larsen, Søren Erik","Andersen, Peter Mejlhede","Audet, Joachim","Hoffmann, Carl Christian","Andersen, Hans Estrup","Kjærgaard, Charlotte","Kronvang, Brian"],"cuid":["S02-081.01-804028"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Baattrup-Pedersen, Annette"],"keyword":["Eutrophication","Habitats Directive","Hydrology","Phosphorus","Water Framework Directive"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"stream characteristics and their implications for the protection of riparian fens and meadows","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-2427.2011.02606.x","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-081.01-804028","identifier":[{"id":"79961026932","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-47feb8de-3bdf-4bea-acd5-102a68af5198","au-b7980215-9b4b-471a-a2dc-d8e1fb814d97"],"keyword":["Eutrophication","Habitats Directive","Hydrology","Phosphorus","Water Framework Directive"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-4D99592D42809FD45345CE30A1CE3199"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-2427.2011.02606.x","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, National Environmental Research Institute, Department of Freshwater Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"A.","key":"baattruppedersenannettepau","last":"Baattrup-Pedersen","locid":"e4f5886d-70a8-4174-a224-b21d0dfc8689","name":"Baattrup-Pedersen, Annette","name_org":"Baattrup-Pedersen, A.","orcid":"0000-0002-3118-344X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"S.E.","key":"larsensørenerikpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"fc89ca38-79d9-4781-a6b1-8394e722b334","name":"Larsen, Søren Erik","name_org":"Larsen, S.E.","orcid":"0000-0001-8428-2065","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Mejlhede","key":"andersenpetermejlhedepau","last":"Andersen","locid":"b701e373-3720-491d-8d91-4a3089836b0b","name":"Andersen, Peter Mejlhede","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"mejlhedepeterpau","last":"Mejlhede","name":"Mejlhede, Peter","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"J.","key":"audetjoachimpau","last":"Audet","locid":"51de9f19-0692-434b-b884-12147bf58637","name":"Audet, Joachim","name_org":"Audet, J.","orcid":"0000-0001-5839-8793","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carl Christian","key":"hoffmanncarlchristianpau","last":"Hoffmann","locid":"353a0760-7b7a-4348-9f47-7df140234554","name":"Hoffmann, Carl Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-1268-9162","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carl Christian","key":"hoffmancarlchristianpau","last":"Hoffman","name":"Hoffman, Carl Christian","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans Estrup","key":"andersenhansestruppau","last":"Andersen","locid":"368cd58b-96d4-4648-bc00-a9ef227b7d97","name":"Andersen, Hans Estrup","orcid":"0000-0003-2465-583X","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"kjærgaardcharlottepau","last":"Kjaergaard","locid":"b3be00f6-c690-4933-946a-9ab606926cdd","name":"Kjærgaard, Charlotte","name_org":"Kjaergaard, Charlotte","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"B.","key":"kronvangbrianpau","last":"Kronvang","locid":"7766931c-a3c9-4a38-9d22-e4cc3a2f4607","name":"Kronvang, Brian","name_org":"Kronvang, B.","orcid":"0000-0003-1165-1354","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/j.1365-2427.2011.02606.x","issn":["00465070","13652427"],"issn_org":["00465070"],"issue":"9","journal":"Freshwater Biology","pages":"1893-1903","publisher":"Wiley-Blackwell Publishing Ltd","publisher_org":"Wiley-Blackwell Publishing Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Freshwater Biology","volume":"56"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79961026932"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-47feb8de-3bdf-4bea-acd5-102a68af5198","au-b7980215-9b4b-471a-a2dc-d8e1fb814d97"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Stream characteristics and their implications for the protection of riparian fens and meadows","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-081.01-804028","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Resultaterne af denne undersøgelse viser at: - Grise med store mængder Lawsonia i gødningen (≥106/gram gødning) har større risiko (OR=5,2) for at være en langsomt voksende gris. - Grise med synlige tarmforandringer har større risiko (OR=13,2) for at være en langsomt voksende gris. - Grise med diarré har større risiko (OR=10,1) for at være en langsomt voksende gris. Derimod kunne der ikke påvises nogen sammenhæng mellem mængden af PCV2 virus, antistoffer mod PCV2 virus eller påvisning af PCV2 virus ved immunhistokemi i tarmlymfeknude og tilvæksten hos grise. Undersøgelsen er gennemført i 5 slagtesvinebesætninger. I hver besætning blev 60 grise fordelt på 4 stier øremærket og vejet efter indsættelse i slagtesvinestalden. Grisene blev fulgt i 6-8 uger hvorefter de blev vejet igen. Grisene blev undersøgt med 14 dages mellemrum. Ved hver besøg blev der udtaget blodprøver, gødningsprøver og grisenes huld blev vurderet. Gødningsprøverne blev vurderet visuelt inden de sammen med blodprøverne blev frosset ned ved minus 80 oC. På den sidste prøvedag blev 5 langsomt voksende grise og 5 hurtigt voksende grise aflivet. De udtagne prøver af de aflivede grise blev undersøgt for PCV2-virus i blod og gødning, Lawsonia i gødning ved real-time PCR specifik for hhv. PCV2 og Lawsonia2,3 og antistoffer mod de to smitstoffer.. Endvidere blev tarmene fra de aflivede grise undersøgt og scoret makroskopisk på Laboratoriet for Svinesygdomme i Kjellerup. Der blev udtaget materiale til histologi og påvisning af antigener mod PCV2 virus og Lawsonia på DTU-Veterinærinstitutet. For hver gris blev den maksimalt målte værdi af Lawsonia og PCV2 virus mængde i gødning og antistoffer mod de to sygdomme brugt som forklarende variabel. Sammenhængen til hurtigt/langsomt voksende grise for de maksimalt målte værdier blev undersøgt ved statistisk analyse.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Johansen, Markku","Nielsen, Mai Britt Friis","Dahl, Jan","Svensmark, Birgitta","Bækbo, Poul","Kristensen, Charlotte Sonne","Hjulsager, Charlotte Kristiane","Jensen, Tim Kåre","Ståhl, Marie","Larsen, Lars Erik","Angen, Øystein"],"cuid":["S02-082.39-037044"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Videncenter for Svineproduktion, Landbrug & Fødevarer"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"betydningen af lawsonia og pcv000000000002 virus for daglig tilvækst hos slagtesvin","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://vsp.lf.dk/Publikationer/Kilder/lu_medd/2011/902.aspx","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-082.39-037044","ids":["dtu-c4b2f4a3-db00-48f8-8e1d-cc336b51c7b2","ku-038785b8-3690-494b-a2ba-175b7847ee7e"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-17230142910DE9FF50522025141BB82B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://vsp.lf.dk/Publikationer/Kilder/lu_medd/2011/902.aspx","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Videncenter for Svineproduktion, Landbrug & Fødevarer"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Veterinary Institute","Technical University of Denmar